'état actuel et payer.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"smartVariableBlock\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"balanceTable\"}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"descriptiveText\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}],\"text\":\"Vous recevez cet e-mail sans savoir de quoi il s\'agit et vous pensez qu\'il est destiné à une autre personne (p. ex. une faute de frappe) ? Désinscrivez-vous alors de nos e-mails via \"},{\"type\":\"smartButtonInline\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"unsubscribeUrl\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}],\"text\":\"ce bouton\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}],\"text\":\" — vous ne recevrez ensuite plus jamais d\'e-mail de notre part.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"smartButtonInline\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"unsubscribeUrl\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Se désinscrire\"}]}]}]}},\"en\":{\"subject\":\"\",\"html\":\"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html>\\n\\n<head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n<meta http-equiv=\\\"X-UA-Compatible\\\" content=\\\"IE=edge\\\" />\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n<title></title>\\n<style type=\\\"text/css\\\">body {\\n  color: #000716;\\n  color: var(--color-dark, #000716);\\n  font-family: -apple-system-body, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\";\\n  font-size: 12pt;\\n  line-height: 1.4;\\n}\\n\\np {\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n  line-height: 1.4;\\n}\\n\\np.description {\\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\\n  font-size: 10pt;\\n}\\np.description a, p.description a:link, p.description a:visited, p.description a:active, p.description a:hover {\\n  text-decoration: underline;\\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\\n}\\n\\nstrong {\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n}\\n\\nem {\\n  font-style: italic;\\n}\\n\\nh1 {\\n  font-size: 30px;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  line-height: 1.2;\\n}\\n@media (max-width: 350px) {\\n  h1 {\\n    font-size: 24px;\\n  }\\n}\\nh1 {\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n}\\n\\nh2 {\\n  font-size: 20px;\\n  line-height: 1.2;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n}\\n\\nh3 {\\n  font-size: 16px;\\n  line-height: 1.2;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n}\\n\\nh4 {\\n  line-height: 1.2;\\n  font-weight: 500;\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n}\\n\\nol, ul {\\n  list-style-position: outside;\\n  padding-left: 30px;\\n}\\n\\nhr {\\n  height: 1px;\\n  background: var(--color-border, var(--color-gray-2, #dcdcdc));\\n  border-radius: 1px;\\n  padding: 0;\\n  margin: 20px 0;\\n  outline: none;\\n  border: 0;\\n}\\n\\n.button {\\n  touch-action: inherit;\\n  user-select: auto;\\n  cursor: pointer;\\n  display: inline-block !important;\\n  line-height: 42px;\\n  font-size: 16px;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  text-box-trim: none;\\n}\\n.button:active {\\n  transform: none;\\n}\\n\\nimg {\\n  max-width: 100%;\\n  height: auto;\\n}\\n\\na, a:link, a:visited, a:active, a:hover {\\n  text-decoration: underline;\\n  color: blue;\\n}\\n\\n.email-data-table {\\n  width: 100%;\\n  border-collapse: collapse;\\n}\\n.email-data-table th, .email-data-table td {\\n  text-align: left;\\n  padding: 10px 10px 10px 0;\\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border, var(--color-gray-2, #dcdcdc));\\n  vertical-align: middle;\\n}\\n.email-data-table th:last-child, .email-data-table td:last-child {\\n  text-align: right;\\n  padding-right: 0;\\n}\\n.email-data-table td.price {\\n  white-space: nowrap;\\n}\\n.email-data-table thead {\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n}\\n.email-data-table thead th {\\n  font-size: 10pt;\\n}\\n.email-data-table h4 ~ p {\\n  padding-top: 3px;\\n  opacity: 0.8;\\n  font-size: 11pt;\\n}\\n\\n.style-inline-code {\\n  font-family: monospace;\\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\\n  display: inline-block;\\n  letter-spacing: 1%;\\n}\\n\\n.style-code-large {\\n  font-family: monospace;\\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\\n  font-size: 16pt;\\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\\n  background: #f2f2f2;\\n  padding: 6px 10px;\\n  border-radius: 6px;\\n  display: inline-block;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-description-small {\\n  font-size: 14px;\\n  line-height: 1.5;\\n  font-weight: normal;\\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\\n  font-variation-settings: \\\"opsz\\\" 19;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-title-list {\\n  font-size: 16px;\\n  line-height: 1.3;\\n  font-weight: 500;\\n}\\n.email-style-title-list + p {\\n  padding-top: 3px;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-title-prefix-list {\\n  font-size: 11px;\\n  line-height: 1.5;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  color: {{primaryColor}};\\n  text-transform: uppercase;\\n  margin-bottom: 3px;\\n}\\n.email-style-title-prefix-list.error {\\n  color: #f0153d;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-price-base, .email-style-discount-price, .email-style-discount-old-price, .email-style-price {\\n  font-size: 15px;\\n  line-height: 1.4;\\n  font-weight: 500;\\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\\n}\\n.email-style-price-base.disabled, .disabled.email-style-discount-price, .disabled.email-style-discount-old-price, .disabled.email-style-price {\\n  opacity: 0.6;\\n}\\n.email-style-price-base.negative, .negative.email-style-discount-price, .negative.email-style-discount-old-price, .negative.email-style-price {\\n  color: #f0153d;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-price {\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  color: {{primaryColor}};\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-discount-old-price {\\n  text-decoration: line-through;\\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-discount-price {\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  color: #ff4747;\\n  margin-left: 5px;\\n}\\n\\n.pre-wrap {\\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\\n} hr {height: 2px;background: #e7e7e7; border-radius: 1px; padding: 0; margin: 20px 0; outline: none; border: 0;} .button.primary { margin: 0; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: {{primaryColorContrast}}; padding: 0 27px; line-height: 42px; background: {{primaryColor}}; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; touch-action: manipulation; display: inline-block; transition: 0.2s transform, 0.2s opacity; } .button.primary:active { transform: scale(0.95, 0.95); }  .inline-link, .inline-link:link, .inline-link:visited, .inline-link:active, .inline-link:hover { margin: 0; text-decoration: underline; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; color: inherit; touch-action: manipulation; } .inline-link:active { opacity: 0.5; }  .description { color: #5e5e5e; } </style>\\n</head>\\n\\n<body>\\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">{{greeting}}</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><strong>Please do not simply transfer money to our account, but always pay via the member portal</strong></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><div data-type=\\\"smartButton\\\" data-id=\\\"paymentUrl\\\"><table width=\\\"100%\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"margin: 5px 0;\\\">\\n<tbody><tr>\\n    <td>\\n        <table cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\">\\n            <tbody><tr>\\n                <td style=\\\"border-radius: 7px;\\\" bgcolor=\\\"{{primaryColor}}\\\">\\n                <a class=\\\"button primary\\\" href=\\\"{{paymentUrl}}\\\" target=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: {{primaryColorContrast}}; padding: 0 27px; line-height: 42px; background: {{primaryColor}}; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; touch-action: manipulation; display: inline-block; transition: 0.2s transform, 0.2s opacity;\\\">Pay via the member portal</a>\\n                </td>\\n            </tr>\\n        </tbody></table>\\n    </td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody></table></div><p class=\\\"description\\\" style=\\\"color: #5e5e5e;\\\"><em>Not sure whether one of our emails is genuine? Then go directly to our member portal via our website without clicking a link in an email. There you can also view your outstanding amount and pay it if needed - that way you are always sure you are paying us and it is not phishing.</em></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p class=\\\"description\\\" style=\\\"color: #5e5e5e;\\\"><strong><em>Questions about your outstanding amount</em></strong><em>? Please contact </em>{{organizationName}} <em>via </em>{{fromAddress}}</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><hr style=\\\"height: 2px;background: #e7e7e7; border-radius: 1px; padding: 0; margin: 20px 0; outline: none; border: 0;\\\"><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><h2 style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0;\\\">Overview</h2><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">This is a snapshot of your current outstanding amount. You can go to the member portal at any time to view the current status and pay.</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><div data-type=\\\"smartVariableBlock\\\" data-id=\\\"balanceTable\\\">{{balanceTable}}</div><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p class=\\\"description\\\" style=\\\"color: #5e5e5e;\\\"><em>Did this email reach you, but you have no idea what it is about and think it was meant for someone else (e.g. a typo)? Then it is best to unsubscribe from our emails via </em><a class=\\\"inline-link\\\" href=\\\"{{unsubscribeUrl}}\\\" target=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0; text-decoration: underline; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; color: inherit; touch-action: manipulation;\\\"><em>this button</em></a><em> — after that you will never receive an email from us again.</em></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><a class=\\\"inline-link\\\" href=\\\"{{unsubscribeUrl}}\\\" target=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0; text-decoration: underline; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; color: inherit; touch-action: manipulation;\\\">Unsubscribe</a></p>\\n</body>\\n\\n</html>\",\"text\":\"{{greeting}}\\n\\nPlease do not simply transfer money to our account, but always pay via the member portal\\n\\nPay via the member portal ({{paymentUrl}})\\n\\nNot sure whether one of our emails is genuine? Then go directly to our member portal via our website without clicking a link in an email. There you can also view your outstanding amount and pay it if needed - that way you are always sure you are paying us and it is not phishing.\\n\\nQuestions about your outstanding amount? Please contact {{organizationName}} via {{fromAddress}}\\n\\nOverview\\n\\nThis is a snapshot of your current outstanding amount. You can go to the member portal at any time to view the current status and pay.\\n\\n{{balanceTable}}\\n\\nDid this email reach you, but you have no idea what it is about and think it was meant for someone else (e.g. a typo)? Then it is best to unsubscribe from our emails via this button ({{unsubscribeUrl}}) — after that you will never receive an email from us again.\\nUnsubscribe ({{unsubscribeUrl}})\",\"json\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"greeting\"}}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"text\":\"Please do not simply transfer money to our account, but always pay via the member portal\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"smartButton\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"paymentUrl\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Pay via the member portal\"}]},{\"type\":\"descriptiveText\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}],\"text\":\"Not sure whether one of our emails is genuine? Then go directly to our member portal via our website without clicking a link in an email. There you can also view your outstanding amount and pay it if needed - that way you are always sure you are paying us and it is not phishing.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"descriptiveText\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"},{\"type\":\"italic\"}],\"text\":\"Questions about your outstanding amount\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}],\"text\":\"? Please contact \"},{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"organizationName\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}],\"text\":\"via \"},{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"fromAddress\"}}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"horizontalRule\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"attrs\":{\"level\":2},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Overview\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"This is a snapshot of your current outstanding amount. You can go to the member portal at any time to view the current status and pay.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"smartVariableBlock\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"balanceTable\"}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"descriptiveText\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}],\"text\":\"Did this email reach you, but you have no idea what it is about and think it was meant for someone else (e.g. a typo)? Then it is best to unsubscribe from our emails via \"},{\"type\":\"smartButtonInline\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"unsubscribeUrl\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}],\"text\":\"this button\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}],\"text\":\" — after that you will never receive an email from us again.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"smartButtonInline\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"unsubscribeUrl\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Unsubscribe\"}]}]}]}}},\"version\":413}', 'nl'),
('33cc9c96-5f73-4156-a74f-54475ac88ee6', '[{{platformName}}] Op {{validUntilDate}} vervalt jouw ledenadministratie pakket', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'MembersExpirationReminder', 'Dag {{firstName}},\nOp {{validUntil}} loopt het abonnement van {{organizationName}} voor het ledenadministratiepakket bij {{platformName}} ten einde. Om te voorkomen dat je de toegang tot gegevens verliest en de ledenadministratie onderbroken wordt, verleng je deze dus best op voorhand (als je dit nog niet zelf gedaan hebt). \nJe kan dit verlengen via de knop hieronder, of door naar de {{platformName}} app/website te gaan en daar bij de instellingen > \'Mijn Pakketten\' de pakketten te verlengen. In de toekomst voorzien we een optie om pakketten (indien gewenst) automatisch te verlengen.\n\n\n    \n        \n            \n                \n                Verleng ledenadministratie\n                \n            \n        \n    \n\nKlik op bovenstaande knop om rechtstreeks naar de instellingen te gaan om het pakket te verlengen. \n\nVeel gestelde vragen\nPakket al verlengd? Geen paniek: in dat geval kan je deze e-mail veilig negeren zolang je in de instellingen van {{platformName}} zelf ziet staan dat het pakket geldig is tot de juiste datum.Wat met leden die stoppen? Als je een lid uitschrijft, komt er één plaats vrij die kan worden ingekomen door een nieuw lid, zonder dat je daarvoor extra hoeft te betalen. Weet je op voorhand dat het aantal leden sterk zal verminderen? Schrijf de leden dan uit voor je het pakket verlengd. Dan hoef je die nog niet te betalen op het moment van de verlenging.Behoud ik de gegevens als ik niet verleng? De gegevens worden maar voor een beperkte periode bijgehouden als het pakket niet verlengd wordt. Kan ik met enkele maanden verlengen, in plaats van één jaar? Dit is voorlopig niet mogelijk.\n\nLaat gerust weten als jullie bijkomende vragen hebben. Dan beantwoorden we die graag.\nMet vriendelijke groeten,{{platformName}}', '<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0\" />\n<title>[{{platformName}}] Op {{validUntilDate}} vervalt jouw ledenadministratie pakket</title>\n<style type=\"text/css\">body {\n  color: #000716;\n  color: var(--color-dark, #000716);\n  font-family: -apple-system-body, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \"Apple Color Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Symbol\";\n  font-size: 12pt;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n\np {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n\np.description {\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\n}\n\nstrong {\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n\nem {\n  font-style: italic;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 30px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n@media (max-width: 350px) {\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 24px;\n  }\n}\n\nh2 {\n  font-size: 20px;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nh3 {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nh4 {\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nol, ul {\n  list-style-position: outside;\n  padding-left: 30px;\n}\n\nhr {\n  height: 1px;\n  background: var(--color-border, var(--color-gray-2, #dcdcdc));\n  border-radius: 1px;\n  padding: 0;\n  margin: 20px 0;\n  outline: none;\n  border: 0;\n}\n\n.button {\n  touch-action: inherit;\n  -webkit-user-select: auto;\n     -moz-user-select: auto;\n      -ms-user-select: auto;\n          user-select: auto;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  display: inline-block !important;\n  line-height: 42px;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n.button:active {\n  transform: none;\n}\n\nimg {\n  max-width: 100%;\n  height: auto;\n}\n\na, a:link, a:visited, a:active, a:hover {\n  text-decoration: underline;\n  color: blue;\n}\n\n.email-data-table {\n  width: 100%;\n  border-collapse: collapse;\n}\n.email-data-table th, .email-data-table td {\n  text-align: left;\n  padding: 10px 10px 10px 0;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border, var(--color-gray-2, #dcdcdc));\n  vertical-align: middle;\n}\n.email-data-table th:last-child, .email-data-table td:last-child {\n  text-align: right;\n  padding-right: 0;\n}\n.email-data-table thead {\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n.email-data-table thead th {\n  font-size: 10pt;\n}\n.email-data-table h4 + p {\n  padding-top: 3px;\n  opacity: 0.8;\n  font-size: 11pt;\n} hr {height: 2px;background: #e7e7e7; border-radius: 1px; padding: 0; margin: 20px 0; outline: none; border: 0;} .button.primary { margin: 0; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: white; padding: 0 27px; line-height: 42px; background: {{primaryColor}}; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; touch-action: manipulation; display: inline-block; transition: 0.2s transform, 0.2s opacity; } .button.primary:active { transform: scale(0.95, 0.95); }  .button { color: #5e5e5e; } </style>\n</head>\n\n<body>\n<p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Dag {{firstName}},</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Op {{validUntil}} loopt het abonnement van {{organizationName}} voor het ledenadministratiepakket bij {{platformName}} ten einde. Om te voorkomen dat je de toegang tot gegevens verliest en de ledenadministratie onderbroken wordt, verleng je deze dus best op voorhand (als je dit nog niet zelf gedaan hebt). </p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Je kan dit verlengen via de knop hieronder, of door naar de {{platformName}} app/website te gaan en daar bij de instellingen &gt; \'Mijn Pakketten\' de pakketten te verlengen. In de toekomst voorzien we een optie om pakketten (indien gewenst) automatisch te verlengen.</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br></p><div data-type=\"smartButton\" data-id=\"renewUrl\"><table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n<tbody><tr>\n    <td>\n        <table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n            <tbody><tr>\n                <td style=\"border-radius: 7px;\" bgcolor=\"{{primaryColor}}\">\n                <a class=\"button primary\" href=\"{{renewUrl}}\" target=\"\" style=\"margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: white; padding: 0px 27px; line-height: 42px; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; touch-action: manipulation; display: inline-block; transition: transform 0.2s ease 0s, opacity 0.2s ease 0s;\">Verleng ledenadministratie</a>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </tbody></table>\n    </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div><p class=\"description\" style=\"color: rgb(94, 94, 94);\"><em>Klik op bovenstaande knop om rechtstreeks naar de instellingen te gaan om het pakket te verlengen. </em></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br></p><hr style=\"height: 2px; background-color: rgb(231, 231, 231); border-radius: 1px; padding: 0px; margin: 20px 0px; outline: none; border: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br></p><h2 style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Veel gestelde vragen</h2><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br></p><ul><li><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>Pakket al verlengd? </strong>Geen paniek: in dat geval kan je deze e-mail veilig negeren zolang je in de instellingen van {{platformName}} zelf ziet staan dat het pakket geldig is tot de juiste datum.</p></li><li><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>Wat met leden die stoppen? </strong>Als je een lid uitschrijft, komt er één plaats vrij die kan worden ingekomen door een nieuw lid, zonder dat je daarvoor extra hoeft te betalen. Weet je op voorhand dat het aantal leden sterk zal verminderen? Schrijf de leden dan uit voor je het pakket verlengd. Dan hoef je die nog niet te betalen op het moment van de verlenging.</p></li><li><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>Behoud ik de gegevens als ik niet verleng? </strong>De gegevens worden maar voor een beperkte periode bijgehouden als het pakket niet verlengd wordt. </p></li><li><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><strong>Kan ik met enkele maanden verlengen, in plaats van één jaar? </strong>Dit is voorlopig niet mogelijk.</p></li></ul><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br></p><hr style=\"height: 2px; background-color: rgb(231, 231, 231); border-radius: 1px; padding: 0px; margin: 20px 0px; outline: none; border: 0px;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Laat gerust weten als jullie bijkomende vragen hebben. Dan beantwoorden we die graag.</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">Met vriendelijke groeten,</p><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px;\">{{platformName}}</p>\n</body>\n\n</html>', '{\"value\": {\"type\": \"doc\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"paragraph\", \"content\": [{\"text\": \"Dag \", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"type\": \"smartVariable\", \"attrs\": {\"id\": \"firstName\"}}, {\"text\": \",\", \"type\": \"text\"}]}, {\"type\": \"paragraph\"}, {\"type\": \"paragraph\", \"content\": [{\"text\": \"Op \", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"type\": \"smartVariable\", \"attrs\": {\"id\": \"validUntil\"}}, {\"text\": \" loopt het abonnement van \", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"type\": \"smartVariable\", \"attrs\": {\"id\": \"organizationName\"}}, {\"text\": \" voor het ledenadministratiepakket bij {{platformName}} ten einde. Om te voorkomen dat je de toegang tot gegevens verliest en de ledenadministratie onderbroken wordt, verleng je deze dus best op voorhand (als je dit nog niet zelf gedaan hebt). \", \"type\": \"text\"}]}, {\"type\": \"paragraph\"}, {\"type\": \"paragraph\", \"content\": [{\"text\": \"Je kan dit verlengen via de knop hieronder, of door naar de {{platformName}} app/website te gaan en daar bij de instellingen > \'Mijn Pakketten\' de pakketten te verlengen. In de toekomst voorzien we een optie om pakketten (indien gewenst) automatisch te verlengen.\", \"type\": \"text\"}]}, {\"type\": \"paragraph\"}, {\"type\": \"smartButton\", \"attrs\": {\"id\": \"renewUrl\"}, \"content\": [{\"text\": \"Verleng ledenadministratie\", \"type\": \"text\"}]}, {\"type\": \"descriptiveText\", \"content\": [{\"text\": \"Klik op bovenstaande knop om rechtstreeks naar de instellingen te gaan om het pakket te verlengen. \", \"type\": \"text\", \"marks\": [{\"type\": \"italic\"}]}]}, {\"type\": \"paragraph\"}, {\"type\": \"horizontalRule\"}, {\"type\": \"paragraph\"}, {\"type\": \"heading\", \"attrs\": {\"level\": 2}, \"content\": [{\"text\": \"Veel gestelde vragen\", \"type\": \"text\"}]}, {\"type\": \"paragraph\"}, {\"type\": \"bulletList\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"listItem\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"paragraph\", \"content\": [{\"text\": \"Pakket al verlengd? \", \"type\": \"text\", \"marks\": [{\"type\": \"bold\"}]}, {\"text\": \"Geen paniek: in dat geval kan je deze e-mail veilig negeren zolang je in de instellingen van {{platformName}} zelf ziet staan dat het pakket geldig is tot de juiste datum.\", \"type\": \"text\"}]}]}, {\"type\": \"listItem\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"paragraph\", \"content\": [{\"text\": \"Wat met leden die stoppen? \", \"type\": \"text\", \"marks\": [{\"type\": \"bold\"}]}, {\"text\": \"Als je een lid uitschrijft, komt er één plaats vrij die kan worden ingekomen door een nieuw lid, zonder dat je daarvoor extra hoeft te betalen. Weet je op voorhand dat het aantal leden sterk zal verminderen? Schrijf de leden dan uit voor je het pakket verlengd. Dan hoef je die nog niet te betalen op het moment van de verlenging.\", \"type\": \"text\"}]}]}, {\"type\": \"listItem\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"paragraph\", \"content\": [{\"text\": \"Behoud ik de gegevens als ik niet verleng? \", \"type\": \"text\", \"marks\": [{\"type\": \"bold\"}]}, {\"text\": \"De gegevens worden maar voor een beperkte periode bijgehouden als het pakket niet verlengd wordt. \", \"type\": \"text\"}]}]}, {\"type\": \"listItem\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"paragraph\", \"content\": [{\"text\": \"Kan ik met enkele maanden verlengen, in plaats van één jaar? \", \"type\": \"text\", \"marks\": [{\"type\": \"bold\"}]}, {\"text\": \"Dit is voorlopig niet mogelijk.\", \"type\": \"text\"}]}]}]}, {\"type\": \"paragraph\"}, {\"type\": \"horizontalRule\"}, {\"type\": \"paragraph\"}, {\"type\": \"paragraph\", \"content\": [{\"text\": \"Laat gerust weten als jullie bijkomende vragen hebben. Dan beantwoorden we die graag.\", \"type\": \"text\"}]}, {\"type\": \"paragraph\"}, {\"type\": \"paragraph\", \"content\": [{\"text\": \"Met vriendelijke groeten,\", \"type\": \"text\"}]}, {\"type\": \"paragraph\", \"content\": [{\"text\": \"{{platformName}}\", \"type\": \"text\"}]}]}, \"version\": 160}', '2022-04-29 15:13:17', '2022-04-29 15:13:17', '{\"value\":{\"fr\":{\"subject\":\"[{{platformName}}] Votre formule d\'administration des membres expire le {{validUntilDate}}\",\"html\":\"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html>\\n\\n<head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n<meta http-equiv=\\\"X-UA-Compatible\\\" content=\\\"IE=edge\\\" />\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n<title>[{{platformName}}] Votre formule d\'administration des membres expire le {{validUntilDate}}</title>\\n<style type=\\\"text/css\\\">body {\\n  color: #000716;\\n  color: var(--color-dark, #000716);\\n  font-family: -apple-system-body, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\";\\n  font-size: 12pt;\\n  line-height: 1.4;\\n}\\n\\np {\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n  line-height: 1.4;\\n}\\n\\np.description {\\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\\n  font-size: 10pt;\\n}\\np.description a, p.description a:link, p.description a:visited, p.description a:active, p.description a:hover {\\n  text-decoration: underline;\\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\\n}\\n\\nstrong {\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n}\\n\\nem {\\n  font-style: italic;\\n}\\n\\nh1 {\\n  font-size: 30px;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  line-height: 1.2;\\n}\\n@media (max-width: 350px) {\\n  h1 {\\n    font-size: 24px;\\n  }\\n}\\nh1 {\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n}\\n\\nh2 {\\n  font-size: 20px;\\n  line-height: 1.2;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n}\\n\\nh3 {\\n  font-size: 16px;\\n  line-height: 1.2;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n}\\n\\nh4 {\\n  line-height: 1.2;\\n  font-weight: 500;\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n}\\n\\nol, ul {\\n  list-style-position: outside;\\n  padding-left: 30px;\\n}\\n\\nhr {\\n  height: 1px;\\n  background: var(--color-border, var(--color-gray-2, #dcdcdc));\\n  border-radius: 1px;\\n  padding: 0;\\n  margin: 20px 0;\\n  outline: none;\\n  border: 0;\\n}\\n\\n.button {\\n  touch-action: inherit;\\n  user-select: auto;\\n  cursor: pointer;\\n  display: inline-block !important;\\n  line-height: 42px;\\n  font-size: 16px;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  text-box-trim: none;\\n}\\n.button:active {\\n  transform: none;\\n}\\n\\nimg {\\n  max-width: 100%;\\n  height: auto;\\n}\\n\\na, a:link, a:visited, a:active, a:hover {\\n  text-decoration: underline;\\n  color: blue;\\n}\\n\\n.email-data-table {\\n  width: 100%;\\n  border-collapse: collapse;\\n}\\n.email-data-table th, .email-data-table td {\\n  text-align: left;\\n  padding: 10px 10px 10px 0;\\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border, var(--color-gray-2, #dcdcdc));\\n  vertical-align: middle;\\n}\\n.email-data-table th:last-child, .email-data-table td:last-child {\\n  text-align: right;\\n  padding-right: 0;\\n}\\n.email-data-table td.price {\\n  white-space: nowrap;\\n}\\n.email-data-table thead {\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n}\\n.email-data-table thead th {\\n  font-size: 10pt;\\n}\\n.email-data-table h4 ~ p {\\n  padding-top: 3px;\\n  opacity: 0.8;\\n  font-size: 11pt;\\n}\\n\\n.style-inline-code {\\n  font-family: monospace;\\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\\n  display: inline-block;\\n  letter-spacing: 1%;\\n}\\n\\n.style-code-large {\\n  font-family: monospace;\\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\\n  font-size: 16pt;\\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\\n  background: #f2f2f2;\\n  padding: 6px 10px;\\n  border-radius: 6px;\\n  display: inline-block;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-description-small {\\n  font-size: 14px;\\n  line-height: 1.5;\\n  font-weight: normal;\\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\\n  font-variation-settings: \\\"opsz\\\" 19;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-title-list {\\n  font-size: 16px;\\n  line-height: 1.3;\\n  font-weight: 500;\\n}\\n.email-style-title-list + p {\\n  padding-top: 3px;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-title-prefix-list {\\n  font-size: 11px;\\n  line-height: 1.5;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  color: {{primaryColor}};\\n  text-transform: uppercase;\\n  margin-bottom: 3px;\\n}\\n.email-style-title-prefix-list.error {\\n  color: #f0153d;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-price-base, .email-style-discount-price, .email-style-discount-old-price, .email-style-price {\\n  font-size: 15px;\\n  line-height: 1.4;\\n  font-weight: 500;\\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\\n}\\n.email-style-price-base.disabled, .disabled.email-style-discount-price, .disabled.email-style-discount-old-price, .disabled.email-style-price {\\n  opacity: 0.6;\\n}\\n.email-style-price-base.negative, .negative.email-style-discount-price, .negative.email-style-discount-old-price, .negative.email-style-price {\\n  color: #f0153d;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-price {\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  color: {{primaryColor}};\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-discount-old-price {\\n  text-decoration: line-through;\\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-discount-price {\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  color: #ff4747;\\n  margin-left: 5px;\\n}\\n\\n.pre-wrap {\\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\\n} hr {height: 2px;background: #e7e7e7; border-radius: 1px; padding: 0; margin: 20px 0; outline: none; border: 0;} .button.primary { margin: 0; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: {{primaryColorContrast}}; padding: 0 27px; line-height: 42px; background: {{primaryColor}}; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; touch-action: manipulation; display: inline-block; transition: 0.2s transform, 0.2s opacity; } .button.primary:active { transform: scale(0.95, 0.95); }  .inline-link, .inline-link:link, .inline-link:visited, .inline-link:active, .inline-link:hover { margin: 0; text-decoration: underline; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; color: inherit; touch-action: manipulation; } .inline-link:active { opacity: 0.5; }  .description { color: #5e5e5e; } </style>\\n</head>\\n\\n<body>\\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">Bonjour {{firstName}},</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">Le {{validUntil}}, l\'abonnement de {{organizationName}} pour la formule d\'administration des membres chez {{platformName}} prend fin. Pour éviter de perdre l\'accès aux données et que l\'administration des membres soit interrompue, il est préférable de la prolonger à l\'avance (si vous ne l\'avez pas encore fait). </p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">Vous pouvez prolonger via le bouton ci-dessous, ou en vous rendant dans l\'application/le site web {{platformName}} et en prolongeant les formules dans les paramètres &gt; « Mes formules ». À l\'avenir, nous prévoyons une option pour prolonger automatiquement les formules (si vous le souhaitez).</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><div data-type=\\\"smartButton\\\" data-id=\\\"renewUrl\\\"><table width=\\\"100%\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"margin: 5px 0;\\\">\\n<tbody><tr>\\n    <td>\\n        <table cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\">\\n            <tbody><tr>\\n                <td style=\\\"border-radius: 7px;\\\" bgcolor=\\\"{{primaryColor}}\\\">\\n                <a class=\\\"button primary\\\" href=\\\"{{renewUrl}}\\\" target=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: {{primaryColorContrast}}; padding: 0 27px; line-height: 42px; background: {{primaryColor}}; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; touch-action: manipulation; display: inline-block; transition: 0.2s transform, 0.2s opacity;\\\">Prolonger l\'administration des membres</a>\\n                </td>\\n            </tr>\\n        </tbody></table>\\n    </td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody></table></div><p class=\\\"description\\\" style=\\\"color: #5e5e5e;\\\"><em>Cliquez sur le bouton ci-dessus pour accéder directement aux paramètres et prolonger la formule. </em></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><hr style=\\\"height: 2px;background: #e7e7e7; border-radius: 1px; padding: 0; margin: 20px 0; outline: none; border: 0;\\\"><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><h2 style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0;\\\">Questions fréquentes</h2><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><ul><li><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><strong>Formule déjà prolongée ? </strong>Pas de panique : dans ce cas, vous pouvez ignorer cet e-mail en toute sécurité tant que vous voyez dans les paramètres de {{platformName}} que la formule est valable jusqu\'à la bonne date.</p></li><li><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><strong>Qu\'en est-il des membres qui arrêtent ? </strong>Si vous désinscrivez un membre, une place se libère et peut être occupée par un nouveau membre, sans frais supplémentaires. Vous savez à l\'avance que le nombre de membres va fortement diminuer ? Désinscrivez alors les membres avant de prolonger la formule. Vous ne devrez alors pas les payer au moment de la prolongation.</p></li><li><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><strong>Est-ce que je conserve les données si je ne prolonge pas ? </strong>Les données ne sont conservées que pendant une période limitée si la formule n\'est pas prolongée. </p></li><li><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><strong>Puis-je prolonger de quelques mois au lieu d\'un an ? </strong>Ce n\'est pas possible pour le moment.</p></li></ul><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><hr style=\\\"height: 2px;background: #e7e7e7; border-radius: 1px; padding: 0; margin: 20px 0; outline: none; border: 0;\\\"><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">N\'hésitez pas à nous faire savoir si vous avez d\'autres questions. Nous y répondrons avec plaisir.</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">Cordialement,</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">{{platformName}}</p>\\n</body>\\n\\n</html>\",\"text\":\"Bonjour {{firstName}},\\n\\nLe {{validUntil}}, l\'abonnement de {{organizationName}} pour la formule d\'administration des membres chez {{platformName}} prend fin. Pour éviter de perdre l\'accès aux données et que l\'administration des membres soit interrompue, il est préférable de la prolonger à l\'avance (si vous ne l\'avez pas encore fait). \\n\\nVous pouvez prolonger via le bouton ci-dessous, ou en vous rendant dans l\'application/le site web {{platformName}} et en prolongeant les formules dans les paramètres > « Mes formules ». À l\'avenir, nous prévoyons une option pour prolonger automatiquement les formules (si vous le souhaitez).\\n\\nProlonger l\'administration des membres ({{renewUrl}})\\n\\nCliquez sur le bouton ci-dessus pour accéder directement aux paramètres et prolonger la formule. \\n\\nQuestions fréquentes\\n\\nFormule déjà prolongée ? Pas de panique : dans ce cas, vous pouvez ignorer cet e-mail en toute sécurité tant que vous voyez dans les paramètres de {{platformName}} que la formule est valable jusqu\'à la bonne date.\\nQu\'en est-il des membres qui arrêtent ? Si vous désinscrivez un membre, une place se libère et peut être occupée par un nouveau membre, sans frais supplémentaires. Vous savez à l\'avance que le nombre de membres va fortement diminuer ? Désinscrivez alors les membres avant de prolonger la formule. Vous ne devrez alors pas les payer au moment de la prolongation.\\nEst-ce que je conserve les données si je ne prolonge pas ? Les données ne sont conservées que pendant une période limitée si la formule n\'est pas prolongée. \\nPuis-je prolonger de quelques mois au lieu d\'un an ? Ce n\'est pas possible pour le moment.\\n\\nN\'hésitez pas à nous faire savoir si vous avez d\'autres questions. Nous y répondrons avec plaisir.\\n\\nCordialement,\\n{{platformName}}\",\"json\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Bonjour \"},{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"firstName\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\",\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Le \"},{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"validUntil\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\", l\'abonnement de \"},{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"organizationName\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" pour la formule d\'administration des membres chez {{platformName}} prend fin. Pour éviter de perdre l\'accès aux données et que l\'administration des membres soit interrompue, il est préférable de la prolonger à l\'avance (si vous ne l\'avez pas encore fait). \"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Vous pouvez prolonger via le bouton ci-dessous, ou en vous rendant dans l\'application/le site web {{platformName}} et en prolongeant les formules dans les paramètres > « Mes formules ». À l\'avenir, nous prévoyons une option pour prolonger automatiquement les formules (si vous le souhaitez).\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"smartButton\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"renewUrl\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Prolonger l\'administration des membres\"}]},{\"type\":\"descriptiveText\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}],\"text\":\"Cliquez sur le bouton ci-dessus pour accéder directement aux paramètres et prolonger la formule. \"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"horizontalRule\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"attrs\":{\"level\":2},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Questions fréquentes\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"text\":\"Formule déjà prolongée ? \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Pas de panique : dans ce cas, vous pouvez ignorer cet e-mail en toute sécurité tant que vous voyez dans les paramètres de {{platformName}} que la formule est valable jusqu\'à la bonne date.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"text\":\"Qu\'en est-il des membres qui arrêtent ? \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Si vous désinscrivez un membre, une place se libère et peut être occupée par un nouveau membre, sans frais supplémentaires. Vous savez à l\'avance que le nombre de membres va fortement diminuer ? Désinscrivez alors les membres avant de prolonger la formule. Vous ne devrez alors pas les payer au moment de la prolongation.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"text\":\"Est-ce que je conserve les données si je ne prolonge pas ? \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Les données ne sont conservées que pendant une période limitée si la formule n\'est pas prolongée. \"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"text\":\"Puis-je prolonger de quelques mois au lieu d\'un an ? \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Ce n\'est pas possible pour le moment.\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"horizontalRule\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"N\'hésitez pas à nous faire savoir si vous avez d\'autres questions. Nous y répondrons avec plaisir.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Cordialement,\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{{platformName}}\"}]}]}},\"en\":{\"subject\":\"[{{platformName}}] Your member administration package expires on {{validUntilDate}}\",\"html\":\"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html>\\n\\n<head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n<meta http-equiv=\\\"X-UA-Compatible\\\" content=\\\"IE=edge\\\" />\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n<title>[{{platformName}}] Your member administration package expires on {{validUntilDate}}</title>\\n<style type=\\\"text/css\\\">body {\\n  color: #000716;\\n  color: var(--color-dark, #000716);\\n  font-family: -apple-system-body, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\";\\n  font-size: 12pt;\\n  line-height: 1.4;\\n}\\n\\np {\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n  line-height: 1.4;\\n}\\n\\np.description {\\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\\n  font-size: 10pt;\\n}\\np.description a, p.description a:link, p.description a:visited, p.description a:active, p.description a:hover {\\n  text-decoration: underline;\\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\\n}\\n\\nstrong {\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n}\\n\\nem {\\n  font-style: italic;\\n}\\n\\nh1 {\\n  font-size: 30px;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  line-height: 1.2;\\n}\\n@media (max-width: 350px) {\\n  h1 {\\n    font-size: 24px;\\n  }\\n}\\nh1 {\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n}\\n\\nh2 {\\n  font-size: 20px;\\n  line-height: 1.2;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n}\\n\\nh3 {\\n  font-size: 16px;\\n  line-height: 1.2;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n}\\n\\nh4 {\\n  line-height: 1.2;\\n  font-weight: 500;\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n}\\n\\nol, ul {\\n  list-style-position: outside;\\n  padding-left: 30px;\\n}\\n\\nhr {\\n  height: 1px;\\n  background: var(--color-border, var(--color-gray-2, #dcdcdc));\\n  border-radius: 1px;\\n  padding: 0;\\n  margin: 20px 0;\\n  outline: none;\\n  border: 0;\\n}\\n\\n.button {\\n  touch-action: inherit;\\n  user-select: auto;\\n  cursor: pointer;\\n  display: inline-block !important;\\n  line-height: 42px;\\n  font-size: 16px;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  text-box-trim: none;\\n}\\n.button:active {\\n  transform: none;\\n}\\n\\nimg {\\n  max-width: 100%;\\n  height: auto;\\n}\\n\\na, a:link, a:visited, a:active, a:hover {\\n  text-decoration: underline;\\n  color: blue;\\n}\\n\\n.email-data-table {\\n  width: 100%;\\n  border-collapse: collapse;\\n}\\n.email-data-table th, .email-data-table td {\\n  text-align: left;\\n  padding: 10px 10px 10px 0;\\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border, var(--color-gray-2, #dcdcdc));\\n  vertical-align: middle;\\n}\\n.email-data-table th:last-child, .email-data-table td:last-child {\\n  text-align: right;\\n  padding-right: 0;\\n}\\n.email-data-table td.price {\\n  white-space: nowrap;\\n}\\n.email-data-table thead {\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n}\\n.email-data-table thead th {\\n  font-size: 10pt;\\n}\\n.email-data-table h4 ~ p {\\n  padding-top: 3px;\\n  opacity: 0.8;\\n  font-size: 11pt;\\n}\\n\\n.style-inline-code {\\n  font-family: monospace;\\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\\n  display: inline-block;\\n  letter-spacing: 1%;\\n}\\n\\n.style-code-large {\\n  font-family: monospace;\\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\\n  font-size: 16pt;\\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\\n  background: #f2f2f2;\\n  padding: 6px 10px;\\n  border-radius: 6px;\\n  display: inline-block;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-description-small {\\n  font-size: 14px;\\n  line-height: 1.5;\\n  font-weight: normal;\\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\\n  font-variation-settings: \\\"opsz\\\" 19;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-title-list {\\n  font-size: 16px;\\n  line-height: 1.3;\\n  font-weight: 500;\\n}\\n.email-style-title-list + p {\\n  padding-top: 3px;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-title-prefix-list {\\n  font-size: 11px;\\n  line-height: 1.5;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  color: {{primaryColor}};\\n  text-transform: uppercase;\\n  margin-bottom: 3px;\\n}\\n.email-style-title-prefix-list.error {\\n  color: #f0153d;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-price-base, .email-style-discount-price, .email-style-discount-old-price, .email-style-price {\\n  font-size: 15px;\\n  line-height: 1.4;\\n  font-weight: 500;\\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\\n}\\n.email-style-price-base.disabled, .disabled.email-style-discount-price, .disabled.email-style-discount-old-price, .disabled.email-style-price {\\n  opacity: 0.6;\\n}\\n.email-style-price-base.negative, .negative.email-style-discount-price, .negative.email-style-discount-old-price, .negative.email-style-price {\\n  color: #f0153d;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-price {\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  color: {{primaryColor}};\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-discount-old-price {\\n  text-decoration: line-through;\\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-discount-price {\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  color: #ff4747;\\n  margin-left: 5px;\\n}\\n\\n.pre-wrap {\\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\\n} hr {height: 2px;background: #e7e7e7; border-radius: 1px; padding: 0; margin: 20px 0; outline: none; border: 0;} .button.primary { margin: 0; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: {{primaryColorContrast}}; padding: 0 27px; line-height: 42px; background: {{primaryColor}}; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; touch-action: manipulation; display: inline-block; transition: 0.2s transform, 0.2s opacity; } .button.primary:active { transform: scale(0.95, 0.95); }  .inline-link, .inline-link:link, .inline-link:visited, .inline-link:active, .inline-link:hover { margin: 0; text-decoration: underline; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; color: inherit; touch-action: manipulation; } .inline-link:active { opacity: 0.5; }  .description { color: #5e5e5e; } </style>\\n</head>\\n\\n<body>\\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">Hi {{firstName}},</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">On {{validUntil}} the subscription of {{organizationName}} for the member administration package at {{platformName}} ends. To avoid losing access to your data and having the member administration interrupted, it is best to renew it in advance (if you have not done so already). </p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">You can renew via the button below, or by going to the {{platformName}} app/website and renewing the packages under settings &gt; \'My packages\'. In the future we will provide an option to renew packages automatically (if desired).</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><div data-type=\\\"smartButton\\\" data-id=\\\"renewUrl\\\"><table width=\\\"100%\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"margin: 5px 0;\\\">\\n<tbody><tr>\\n    <td>\\n        <table cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\">\\n            <tbody><tr>\\n                <td style=\\\"border-radius: 7px;\\\" bgcolor=\\\"{{primaryColor}}\\\">\\n                <a class=\\\"button primary\\\" href=\\\"{{renewUrl}}\\\" target=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: {{primaryColorContrast}}; padding: 0 27px; line-height: 42px; background: {{primaryColor}}; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; touch-action: manipulation; display: inline-block; transition: 0.2s transform, 0.2s opacity;\\\">Renew member administration</a>\\n                </td>\\n            </tr>\\n        </tbody></table>\\n    </td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody></table></div><p class=\\\"description\\\" style=\\\"color: #5e5e5e;\\\"><em>Click the button above to go directly to the settings to renew the package. </em></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><hr style=\\\"height: 2px;background: #e7e7e7; border-radius: 1px; padding: 0; margin: 20px 0; outline: none; border: 0;\\\"><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><h2 style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0;\\\">Frequently asked questions</h2><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><ul><li><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><strong>Already renewed the package? </strong>No worries: in that case you can safely ignore this email as long as you can see in the {{platformName}} settings that the package is valid until the correct date.</p></li><li><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><strong>What about members who quit? </strong>If you unregister a member, one place becomes available that can be taken by a new member, without having to pay extra. Do you know in advance that the number of members will decrease significantly? Then unregister those members before you renew the package. That way you do not have to pay for them at the time of renewal.</p></li><li><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><strong>Do I keep my data if I do not renew? </strong>The data is only kept for a limited period if the package is not renewed. </p></li><li><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><strong>Can I renew for a few months instead of one year? </strong>This is not possible for now.</p></li></ul><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><hr style=\\\"height: 2px;background: #e7e7e7; border-radius: 1px; padding: 0; margin: 20px 0; outline: none; border: 0;\\\"><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">Feel free to let us know if you have any further questions. We will be happy to answer them.</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">Kind regards,</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">{{platformName}}</p>\\n</body>\\n\\n</html>\",\"text\":\"Hi {{firstName}},\\n\\nOn {{validUntil}} the subscription of {{organizationName}} for the member administration package at {{platformName}} ends. To avoid losing access to your data and having the member administration interrupted, it is best to renew it in advance (if you have not done so already). \\n\\nYou can renew via the button below, or by going to the {{platformName}} app/website and renewing the packages under settings > \'My packages\'. In the future we will provide an option to renew packages automatically (if desired).\\n\\nRenew member administration ({{renewUrl}})\\n\\nClick the button above to go directly to the settings to renew the package. \\n\\nFrequently asked questions\\n\\nAlready renewed the package? No worries: in that case you can safely ignore this email as long as you can see in the {{platformName}} settings that the package is valid until the correct date.\\nWhat about members who quit? If you unregister a member, one place becomes available that can be taken by a new member, without having to pay extra. Do you know in advance that the number of members will decrease significantly? Then unregister those members before you renew the package. That way you do not have to pay for them at the time of renewal.\\nDo I keep my data if I do not renew? The data is only kept for a limited period if the package is not renewed. \\nCan I renew for a few months instead of one year? This is not possible for now.\\n\\nFeel free to let us know if you have any further questions. We will be happy to answer them.\\n\\nKind regards,\\n{{platformName}}\",\"json\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Hi \"},{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"firstName\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\",\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"On \"},{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"validUntil\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" the subscription of \"},{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"organizationName\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" for the member administration package at {{platformName}} ends. To avoid losing access to your data and having the member administration interrupted, it is best to renew it in advance (if you have not done so already). \"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"You can renew via the button below, or by going to the {{platformName}} app/website and renewing the packages under settings > \'My packages\'. In the future we will provide an option to renew packages automatically (if desired).\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"smartButton\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"renewUrl\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Renew member administration\"}]},{\"type\":\"descriptiveText\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}],\"text\":\"Click the button above to go directly to the settings to renew the package. \"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"horizontalRule\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"attrs\":{\"level\":2},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Frequently asked questions\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"text\":\"Already renewed the package? \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"No worries: in that case you can safely ignore this email as long as you can see in the {{platformName}} settings that the package is valid until the correct date.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"text\":\"What about members who quit? \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"If you unregister a member, one place becomes available that can be taken by a new member, without having to pay extra. Do you know in advance that the number of members will decrease significantly? Then unregister those members before you renew the package. That way you do not have to pay for them at the time of renewal.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"text\":\"Do I keep my data if I do not renew? \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The data is only kept for a limited period if the package is not renewed. \"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"text\":\"Can I renew for a few months instead of one year? \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"This is not possible for now.\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"horizontalRule\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Feel free to let us know if you have any further questions. We will be happy to answer them.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Kind regards,\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{{platformName}}\"}]}]}}},\"version\":413}', 'nl'),
('3624fe92-3021-4b70-a740-7acac32db6ef', 'Jouw openstaand saldo bij {{organizationName}}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'UserBalanceIncreaseNotification', '{{greeting}}Je hebt een nieuw openstaand bedrag van {{outstandingBalance}} bij {{organizationName}}. Je kan de betaling in orde brengen door naar het ledenportaal te gaan. Daar kan je ook een detail bekijken van het openstaande bedrag.Gelieve niet zomaar geld over te schrijven op onze rekening, maar altijd te betalen via het ledenportaal.\n\n    \n        \n            \n                \n                Betalen via het ledenportaal\n                \n            \n        \n    \n\nTwijfel je of één van onze e-mails wel echt is? Ga dan zelf rechtstreeks naar het ledenportaal via onze website zonder op een link in een e-mail te klikken. Via die weg kan je ook je openstaand bedrag bekijken en eventueel betalen - dan ben je altijd zeker dat je aan ons betaalt en het geen phishing is.Vragen over je openstaand bedrag? Neem dan contact op met {{organizationName}} via {{fromAddress}}OverzichtDit is een momentopname van je huidige openstaande bedrag. Je kan op elk moment naar het ledenportaal gaan om de huidige status te bekijken en te betalen.{{balanceTable}}Komt deze e-mail bij jou terecht, maar weet je niet waarover dit gaat en denk je dat dit aan een andere persoon is gericht (bv. een typefout)? Dan schrijf je best uit voor onze e-mails via deze knop — hierna zal je nooit meer een e-mail van ons ontvangen.Uitschrijven', '<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0\" />\n<title>Jouw openstaand saldo bij {{organizationName}}</title>\n<style type=\"text/css\">body {\n  color: #000716;\n  color: var(--color-dark, #000716);\n  font-family: -apple-system-body, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \"Apple Color Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Symbol\";\n  font-size: 12pt;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n\np {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n\np.description {\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\n}\np.description a, p.description a:link, p.description a:visited, p.description a:active, p.description a:hover {\n  text-decoration: underline;\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\n}\n\nstrong {\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n\nem {\n  font-style: italic;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 30px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n@media (max-width: 350px) {\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 24px;\n  }\n}\n\nh2 {\n  font-size: 20px;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nh3 {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nh4 {\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nol, ul {\n  list-style-position: outside;\n  padding-left: 30px;\n}\n\nhr {\n  height: 1px;\n  background: var(--color-border, var(--color-gray-2, #dcdcdc));\n  border-radius: 1px;\n  padding: 0;\n  margin: 20px 0;\n  outline: none;\n  border: 0;\n}\n\n.button {\n  touch-action: inherit;\n  user-select: auto;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  display: inline-block !important;\n  line-height: 42px;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n.button:active {\n  transform: none;\n}\n\nimg {\n  max-width: 100%;\n  height: auto;\n}\n\na, a:link, a:visited, a:active, a:hover {\n  text-decoration: underline;\n  color: blue;\n}\n\n.email-data-table {\n  width: 100%;\n  border-collapse: collapse;\n}\n.email-data-table th, .email-data-table td {\n  text-align: left;\n  padding: 10px 10px 10px 0;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border, var(--color-gray-2, #dcdcdc));\n  vertical-align: middle;\n}\n.email-data-table th:last-child, .email-data-table td:last-child {\n  text-align: right;\n  padding-right: 0;\n}\n.email-data-table thead {\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n.email-data-table thead th {\n  font-size: 10pt;\n}\n.email-data-table h4 ~ p {\n  padding-top: 3px;\n  opacity: 0.8;\n  font-size: 11pt;\n}\n\n.email-style-inline-code {\n  font-family: monospace;\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\n  display: inline-block;\n}\n\n.email-style-description-small {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  font-weight: normal;\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\n  font-variation-settings: \"opsz\" 19;\n}\n\n.email-style-title-list {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  line-height: 1.3;\n  font-weight: 500;\n}\n.email-style-title-list + p {\n  padding-top: 3px;\n}\n\n.email-style-title-prefix-list {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  color: {{primaryColor}};\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  margin-bottom: 3px;\n}\n.email-style-title-prefix-list.error {\n  color: #f0153d;\n}\n\n.email-style-price-base, .email-style-discount-price, .email-style-discount-old-price, .email-style-price {\n  font-size: 15px;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n}\n.email-style-price-base.disabled, .disabled.email-style-discount-price, .disabled.email-style-discount-old-price, .disabled.email-style-price {\n  opacity: 0.6;\n}\n.email-style-price-base.negative, .negative.email-style-discount-price, .negative.email-style-discount-old-price, .negative.email-style-price {\n  color: #f0153d;\n}\n\n.email-style-price {\n  font-weight: bold;\n  color: {{primaryColor}};\n}\n\n.email-style-discount-old-price {\n  text-decoration: line-through;\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\n}\n\n.email-style-discount-price {\n  font-weight: bold;\n  color: #ff4747;\n  margin-left: 5px;\n}\n\n.pre-wrap {\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\n} hr {height: 2px;background: #e7e7e7; border-radius: 1px; padding: 0; margin: 20px 0; outline: none; border: 0;} .button.primary { margin: 0; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: {{primaryColorContrast}}; padding: 0 27px; line-height: 42px; background: {{primaryColor}}; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; touch-action: manipulation; display: inline-block; transition: 0.2s transform, 0.2s opacity; } .button.primary:active { transform: scale(0.95, 0.95); }  .inline-link, .inline-link:link, .inline-link:visited, .inline-link:active, .inline-link:hover { margin: 0; text-decoration: underline; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; color: inherit; touch-action: manipulation; } .inline-link:active { opacity: 0.5; }  .description { color: #5e5e5e; } </style>\n</head>\n\n<body>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\">{{greeting}}</p><p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\">Je hebt een nieuw openstaand bedrag van {{outstandingBalance}} bij {{organizationName}}. Je kan de betaling in orde brengen door naar het ledenportaal te gaan. Daar kan je ook een detail bekijken van het openstaande bedrag.</p><p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong>Gelieve niet zomaar geld over te schrijven op onze rekening, maar altijd te betalen via het ledenportaal.</strong></p><p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\"><br></p><div data-type=\"smartButton\" data-id=\"paymentUrl\"><table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"margin: 5px 0;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n    <td>\n        <table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n            <tbody><tr>\n                <td style=\"border-radius: 7px;\" bgcolor=\"{{primaryColor}}\">\n                <a class=\"button primary\" href=\"{{paymentUrl}}\" target=\"\" style=\"margin: 0; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: {{primaryColorContrast}}; padding: 0 27px; line-height: 42px; background: {{primaryColor}}; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; touch-action: manipulation; display: inline-block; transition: 0.2s transform, 0.2s opacity;\">Betalen via het ledenportaal</a>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </tbody></table>\n    </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div><p class=\"description\" style=\"color: #5e5e5e;\"><em>Twijfel je of één van onze e-mails wel echt is? Ga dan zelf rechtstreeks naar het ledenportaal via onze website zonder op een link in een e-mail te klikken. Via die weg kan je ook je openstaand bedrag bekijken en eventueel betalen - dan ben je altijd zeker dat je aan ons betaalt en het geen phishing is.</em></p><p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\"><br></p><p class=\"description\" style=\"color: #5e5e5e;\"><strong><em>Vragen over je openstaand bedrag</em></strong><em>? Neem dan contact op met </em>{{organizationName}} <em>via </em>{{fromAddress}}</p><p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\"><br></p><hr style=\"height: 2px;background: #e7e7e7; border-radius: 1px; padding: 0; margin: 20px 0; outline: none; border: 0;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\"><br></p><h2 style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0;\">Overzicht</h2><p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\">Dit is een momentopname van je huidige openstaande bedrag. Je kan op elk moment naar het ledenportaal gaan om de huidige status te bekijken en te betalen.</p><p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\"><br></p><div data-type=\"smartVariableBlock\" data-id=\"balanceTable\">{{balanceTable}}</div><p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\"><br></p><p class=\"description\" style=\"color: #5e5e5e;\"><em>Komt deze e-mail bij jou terecht, maar weet je niet waarover dit gaat en denk je dat dit aan een andere persoon is gericht (bv. een typefout)? Dan schrijf je best uit voor onze e-mails via </em><a class=\"inline-link\" href=\"{{unsubscribeUrl}}\" target=\"\" style=\"margin: 0; text-decoration: underline; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; color: inherit; touch-action: manipulation;\"><em>deze knop</em></a><em> — hierna zal je nooit meer een e-mail van ons ontvangen.</em></p><p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\"><a class=\"inline-link\" href=\"{{unsubscribeUrl}}\" target=\"\" style=\"margin: 0; text-decoration: underline; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; color: inherit; touch-action: manipulation;\">Uitschrijven</a></p>\n</body>\n\n</html>', '{\"value\": {\"type\": \"doc\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"paragraph\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"smartVariable\", \"attrs\": {\"id\": \"greeting\"}}]}, {\"type\": \"paragraph\"}, {\"type\": \"paragraph\", \"content\": [{\"text\": \"Je hebt een nieuw openstaand bedrag van \", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"type\": \"smartVariable\", \"attrs\": {\"id\": \"outstandingBalance\"}}, {\"text\": \" bij \", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"type\": \"smartVariable\", \"attrs\": {\"id\": \"organizationName\"}}, {\"text\": \". Je kan de betaling in orde brengen door naar het ledenportaal te gaan. Daar kan je ook een detail bekijken van het openstaande bedrag.\", \"type\": \"text\"}]}, {\"type\": \"paragraph\"}, {\"type\": \"paragraph\", \"content\": [{\"text\": \"Gelieve niet zomaar geld over te schrijven op onze rekening, maar altijd te betalen via het ledenportaal.\", \"type\": \"text\", \"marks\": [{\"type\": \"bold\"}]}]}, {\"type\": \"paragraph\"}, {\"type\": \"smartButton\", \"attrs\": {\"id\": \"paymentUrl\"}, \"content\": [{\"text\": \"Betalen via het ledenportaal\", \"type\": \"text\"}]}, {\"type\": \"descriptiveText\", \"content\": [{\"text\": \"Twijfel je of één van onze e-mails wel echt is? Ga dan zelf rechtstreeks naar het ledenportaal via onze website zonder op een link in een e-mail te klikken. Via die weg kan je ook je openstaand bedrag bekijken en eventueel betalen - dan ben je altijd zeker dat je aan ons betaalt en het geen phishing is.\", \"type\": \"text\", \"marks\": [{\"type\": \"italic\"}]}]}, {\"type\": \"paragraph\"}, {\"type\": \"descriptiveText\", \"content\": [{\"text\": \"Vragen over je openstaand bedrag\", \"type\": \"text\", \"marks\": [{\"type\": \"bold\"}, {\"type\": \"italic\"}]}, {\"text\": \"? Neem dan contact op met \", \"type\": \"text\", \"marks\": [{\"type\": \"italic\"}]}, {\"type\": \"smartVariable\", \"attrs\": {\"id\": \"organizationName\"}}, {\"text\": \" \", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"text\": \"via \", \"type\": \"text\", \"marks\": [{\"type\": \"italic\"}]}, {\"type\": \"smartVariable\", \"attrs\": {\"id\": \"fromAddress\"}}]}, {\"type\": \"paragraph\"}, {\"type\": \"horizontalRule\"}, {\"type\": \"paragraph\"}, {\"type\": \"heading\", \"attrs\": {\"level\": 2}, \"content\": [{\"text\": \"Overzicht\", \"type\": \"text\"}]}, {\"type\": \"paragraph\"}, {\"type\": \"paragraph\", \"content\": [{\"text\": \"Dit is een momentopname van je huidige openstaande bedrag. Je kan op elk moment naar het ledenportaal gaan om de huidige status te bekijken en te betalen.\", \"type\": \"text\"}]}, {\"type\": \"paragraph\"}, {\"type\": \"smartVariableBlock\", \"attrs\": {\"id\": \"balanceTable\"}}, {\"type\": \"paragraph\"}, {\"type\": \"paragraph\"}, {\"type\": \"descriptiveText\", \"content\": [{\"text\": \"Komt deze e-mail bij jou terecht, maar weet je niet waarover dit gaat en denk je dat dit aan een andere persoon is gericht (bv. een typefout)? Dan schrijf je best uit voor onze e-mails via \", \"type\": \"text\", \"marks\": [{\"type\": \"italic\"}]}, {\"type\": \"smartButtonInline\", \"attrs\": {\"id\": \"unsubscribeUrl\"}, \"content\": [{\"text\": \"deze knop\", \"type\": \"text\", \"marks\": [{\"type\": \"italic\"}]}]}, {\"text\": \" — hierna zal je nooit meer een e-mail van ons ontvangen.\", \"type\": \"text\", \"marks\": [{\"type\": \"italic\"}]}]}, {\"type\": \"paragraph\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"smartButtonInline\", \"attrs\": {\"id\": \"unsubscribeUrl\"}, \"content\": [{\"text\": \"Uitschrijven\", \"type\": \"text\"}]}]}]}, \"version\": 354}', '2025-01-04 10:09:48', '2025-01-04 10:09:48', '{\"value\":{\"fr\":{\"subject\":\"Votre solde dû auprès de {{organizationName}}\",\"html\":\"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html>\\n\\n<head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n<meta http-equiv=\\\"X-UA-Compatible\\\" content=\\\"IE=edge\\\" />\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n<title>Votre solde dû auprès de {{organizationName}}</title>\\n<style type=\\\"text/css\\\">body {\\n  color: #000716;\\n  color: var(--color-dark, #000716);\\n  font-family: -apple-system-body, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\";\\n  font-size: 12pt;\\n  line-height: 1.4;\\n}\\n\\np {\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n  line-height: 1.4;\\n}\\n\\np.description {\\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\\n  font-size: 10pt;\\n}\\np.description a, p.description a:link, p.description a:visited, p.description a:active, p.description a:hover {\\n  text-decoration: underline;\\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\\n}\\n\\nstrong {\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n}\\n\\nem {\\n  font-style: italic;\\n}\\n\\nh1 {\\n  font-size: 30px;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  line-height: 1.2;\\n}\\n@media (max-width: 350px) {\\n  h1 {\\n    font-size: 24px;\\n  }\\n}\\nh1 {\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n}\\n\\nh2 {\\n  font-size: 20px;\\n  line-height: 1.2;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n}\\n\\nh3 {\\n  font-size: 16px;\\n  line-height: 1.2;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n}\\n\\nh4 {\\n  line-height: 1.2;\\n  font-weight: 500;\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n}\\n\\nol, ul {\\n  list-style-position: outside;\\n  padding-left: 30px;\\n}\\n\\nhr {\\n  height: 1px;\\n  background: var(--color-border, var(--color-gray-2, #dcdcdc));\\n  border-radius: 1px;\\n  padding: 0;\\n  margin: 20px 0;\\n  outline: none;\\n  border: 0;\\n}\\n\\n.button {\\n  touch-action: inherit;\\n  user-select: auto;\\n  cursor: pointer;\\n  display: inline-block !important;\\n  line-height: 42px;\\n  font-size: 16px;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  text-box-trim: none;\\n}\\n.button:active {\\n  transform: none;\\n}\\n\\nimg {\\n  max-width: 100%;\\n  height: auto;\\n}\\n\\na, a:link, a:visited, a:active, a:hover {\\n  text-decoration: underline;\\n  color: blue;\\n}\\n\\n.email-data-table {\\n  width: 100%;\\n  border-collapse: collapse;\\n}\\n.email-data-table th, .email-data-table td {\\n  text-align: left;\\n  padding: 10px 10px 10px 0;\\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border, var(--color-gray-2, #dcdcdc));\\n  vertical-align: middle;\\n}\\n.email-data-table th:last-child, .email-data-table td:last-child {\\n  text-align: right;\\n  padding-right: 0;\\n}\\n.email-data-table td.price {\\n  white-space: nowrap;\\n}\\n.email-data-table thead {\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n}\\n.email-data-table thead th {\\n  font-size: 10pt;\\n}\\n.email-data-table h4 ~ p {\\n  padding-top: 3px;\\n  opacity: 0.8;\\n  font-size: 11pt;\\n}\\n\\n.style-inline-code {\\n  font-family: monospace;\\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\\n  display: inline-block;\\n  letter-spacing: 1%;\\n}\\n\\n.style-code-large {\\n  font-family: monospace;\\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\\n  font-size: 16pt;\\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\\n  background: #f2f2f2;\\n  padding: 6px 10px;\\n  border-radius: 6px;\\n  display: inline-block;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-description-small {\\n  font-size: 14px;\\n  line-height: 1.5;\\n  font-weight: normal;\\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\\n  font-variation-settings: \\\"opsz\\\" 19;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-title-list {\\n  font-size: 16px;\\n  line-height: 1.3;\\n  font-weight: 500;\\n}\\n.email-style-title-list + p {\\n  padding-top: 3px;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-title-prefix-list {\\n  font-size: 11px;\\n  line-height: 1.5;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  color: {{primaryColor}};\\n  text-transform: uppercase;\\n  margin-bottom: 3px;\\n}\\n.email-style-title-prefix-list.error {\\n  color: #f0153d;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-price-base, .email-style-discount-price, .email-style-discount-old-price, .email-style-price {\\n  font-size: 15px;\\n  line-height: 1.4;\\n  font-weight: 500;\\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\\n}\\n.email-style-price-base.disabled, .disabled.email-style-discount-price, .disabled.email-style-discount-old-price, .disabled.email-style-price {\\n  opacity: 0.6;\\n}\\n.email-style-price-base.negative, .negative.email-style-discount-price, .negative.email-style-discount-old-price, .negative.email-style-price {\\n  color: #f0153d;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-price {\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  color: {{primaryColor}};\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-discount-old-price {\\n  text-decoration: line-through;\\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-discount-price {\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  color: #ff4747;\\n  margin-left: 5px;\\n}\\n\\n.pre-wrap {\\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\\n} hr {height: 2px;background: #e7e7e7; border-radius: 1px; padding: 0; margin: 20px 0; outline: none; border: 0;} .button.primary { margin: 0; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: {{primaryColorContrast}}; padding: 0 27px; line-height: 42px; background: {{primaryColor}}; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; touch-action: manipulation; display: inline-block; transition: 0.2s transform, 0.2s opacity; } .button.primary:active { transform: scale(0.95, 0.95); }  .inline-link, .inline-link:link, .inline-link:visited, .inline-link:active, .inline-link:hover { margin: 0; text-decoration: underline; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; color: inherit; touch-action: manipulation; } .inline-link:active { opacity: 0.5; }  .description { color: #5e5e5e; } </style>\\n</head>\\n\\n<body>\\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">{{greeting}}</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">Vous avez un nouveau montant dû de {{outstandingBalance}} auprès de {{organizationName}}. Vous pouvez régler le paiement en vous rendant sur le portail des membres. Vous pouvez également y consulter le détail du montant dû.</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><strong>Veuillez ne pas virer d\'argent directement sur notre compte, mais toujours payer via le portail des membres.</strong></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><div data-type=\\\"smartButton\\\" data-id=\\\"paymentUrl\\\"><table width=\\\"100%\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"margin: 5px 0;\\\">\\n<tbody><tr>\\n    <td>\\n        <table cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\">\\n            <tbody><tr>\\n                <td style=\\\"border-radius: 7px;\\\" bgcolor=\\\"{{primaryColor}}\\\">\\n                <a class=\\\"button primary\\\" href=\\\"{{paymentUrl}}\\\" target=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: {{primaryColorContrast}}; padding: 0 27px; line-height: 42px; background: {{primaryColor}}; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; touch-action: manipulation; display: inline-block; transition: 0.2s transform, 0.2s opacity;\\\">Payer via le portail des membres</a>\\n                </td>\\n            </tr>\\n        </tbody></table>\\n    </td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody></table></div><p class=\\\"description\\\" style=\\\"color: #5e5e5e;\\\"><em>Vous doutez de l\'authenticité de l\'un de nos e-mails ? Rendez-vous alors directement sur le portail des membres via notre site web, sans cliquer sur un lien dans un e-mail. Vous pouvez y consulter votre montant dû et éventuellement le payer - vous êtes ainsi toujours certain de nous payer et qu\'il ne s\'agit pas de phishing.</em></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p class=\\\"description\\\" style=\\\"color: #5e5e5e;\\\"><strong><em>Des questions sur votre montant dû</em></strong><em> ? Contactez </em>{{organizationName}} <em>via </em>{{fromAddress}}</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><hr style=\\\"height: 2px;background: #e7e7e7; border-radius: 1px; padding: 0; margin: 20px 0; outline: none; border: 0;\\\"><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><h2 style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0;\\\">Aperçu</h2><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">Ceci est un instantané de votre montant dû actuel. Vous pouvez à tout moment vous rendre sur le portail des membres pour consulter l\'état actuel et payer.</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><div data-type=\\\"smartVariableBlock\\\" data-id=\\\"balanceTable\\\">{{balanceTable}}</div><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p class=\\\"description\\\" style=\\\"color: #5e5e5e;\\\"><em>Vous recevez cet e-mail sans savoir de quoi il s\'agit et vous pensez qu\'il est destiné à une autre personne (p. ex. une faute de frappe) ? Désinscrivez-vous alors de nos e-mails via </em><a class=\\\"inline-link\\\" href=\\\"{{unsubscribeUrl}}\\\" target=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0; text-decoration: underline; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; color: inherit; touch-action: manipulation;\\\"><em>ce bouton</em></a><em> — vous ne recevrez ensuite plus jamais d\'e-mail de notre part.</em></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><a class=\\\"inline-link\\\" href=\\\"{{unsubscribeUrl}}\\\" target=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0; text-decoration: underline; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; color: inherit; touch-action: manipulation;\\\">Se désinscrire</a></p>\\n</body>\\n\\n</html>\",\"text\":\"{{greeting}}\\n\\nVous avez un nouveau montant dû de {{outstandingBalance}} auprès de {{organizationName}}. Vous pouvez régler le paiement en vous rendant sur le portail des membres. Vous pouvez également y consulter le détail du montant dû.\\n\\nVeuillez ne pas virer d\'argent directement sur notre compte, mais toujours payer via le portail des membres.\\n\\nPayer via le portail des membres ({{paymentUrl}})\\n\\nVous doutez de l\'authenticité de l\'un de nos e-mails ? Rendez-vous alors directement sur le portail des membres via notre site web, sans cliquer sur un lien dans un e-mail. Vous pouvez y consulter votre montant dû et éventuellement le payer - vous êtes ainsi toujours certain de nous payer et qu\'il ne s\'agit pas de phishing.\\n\\nDes questions sur votre montant dû ? Contactez {{organizationName}} via {{fromAddress}}\\n\\nAperçu\\n\\nCeci est un instantané de votre montant dû actuel. Vous pouvez à tout moment vous rendre sur le portail des membres pour consulter l\'état actuel et payer.\\n\\n{{balanceTable}}\\n\\nVous recevez cet e-mail sans savoir de quoi il s\'agit et vous pensez qu\'il est destiné à une autre personne (p. ex. une faute de frappe) ? Désinscrivez-vous alors de nos e-mails via ce bouton ({{unsubscribeUrl}}) — vous ne recevrez ensuite plus jamais d\'e-mail de notre part.\\nSe désinscrire ({{unsubscribeUrl}})\",\"json\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"greeting\"}}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Vous avez un nouveau montant dû de \"},{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"outstandingBalance\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" auprès de \"},{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"organizationName\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\". Vous pouvez régler le paiement en vous rendant sur le portail des membres. Vous pouvez également y consulter le détail du montant dû.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"text\":\"Veuillez ne pas virer d\'argent directement sur notre compte, mais toujours payer via le portail des membres.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"smartButton\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"paymentUrl\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Payer via le portail des membres\"}]},{\"type\":\"descriptiveText\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}],\"text\":\"Vous doutez de l\'authenticité de l\'un de nos e-mails ? Rendez-vous alors directement sur le portail des membres via notre site web, sans cliquer sur un lien dans un e-mail. Vous pouvez y consulter votre montant dû et éventuellement le payer - vous êtes ainsi toujours certain de nous payer et qu\'il ne s\'agit pas de phishing.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"descriptiveText\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"},{\"type\":\"italic\"}],\"text\":\"Des questions sur votre montant dû\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}],\"text\":\" ? Contactez \"},{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"organizationName\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}],\"text\":\"via \"},{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"fromAddress\"}}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"horizontalRule\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"attrs\":{\"level\":2},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Aperçu\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Ceci est un instantané de votre montant dû actuel. Vous pouvez à tout moment vous rendre sur le portail des membres pour consulter l\'état actuel et payer.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"smartVariableBlock\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"balanceTable\"}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"descriptiveText\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}],\"text\":\"Vous recevez cet e-mail sans savoir de quoi il s\'agit et vous pensez qu\'il est destiné à une autre personne (p. ex. une faute de frappe) ? Désinscrivez-vous alors de nos e-mails via \"},{\"type\":\"smartButtonInline\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"unsubscribeUrl\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}],\"text\":\"ce bouton\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}],\"text\":\" — vous ne recevrez ensuite plus jamais d\'e-mail de notre part.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"smartButtonInline\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"unsubscribeUrl\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Se désinscrire\"}]}]}]}},\"en\":{\"subject\":\"Your outstanding balance at {{organizationName}}\",\"html\":\"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html>\\n\\n<head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n<meta http-equiv=\\\"X-UA-Compatible\\\" content=\\\"IE=edge\\\" />\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n<title>Your outstanding balance at {{organizationName}}</title>\\n<style type=\\\"text/css\\\">body {\\n  color: #000716;\\n  color: var(--color-dark, #000716);\\n  font-family: -apple-system-body, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\";\\n  font-size: 12pt;\\n  line-height: 1.4;\\n}\\n\\np {\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n  line-height: 1.4;\\n}\\n\\np.description {\\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\\n  font-size: 10pt;\\n}\\np.description a, p.description a:link, p.description a:visited, p.description a:active, p.description a:hover {\\n  text-decoration: underline;\\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\\n}\\n\\nstrong {\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n}\\n\\nem {\\n  font-style: italic;\\n}\\n\\nh1 {\\n  font-size: 30px;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  line-height: 1.2;\\n}\\n@media (max-width: 350px) {\\n  h1 {\\n    font-size: 24px;\\n  }\\n}\\nh1 {\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n}\\n\\nh2 {\\n  font-size: 20px;\\n  line-height: 1.2;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n}\\n\\nh3 {\\n  font-size: 16px;\\n  line-height: 1.2;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n}\\n\\nh4 {\\n  line-height: 1.2;\\n  font-weight: 500;\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n}\\n\\nol, ul {\\n  list-style-position: outside;\\n  padding-left: 30px;\\n}\\n\\nhr {\\n  height: 1px;\\n  background: var(--color-border, var(--color-gray-2, #dcdcdc));\\n  border-radius: 1px;\\n  padding: 0;\\n  margin: 20px 0;\\n  outline: none;\\n  border: 0;\\n}\\n\\n.button {\\n  touch-action: inherit;\\n  user-select: auto;\\n  cursor: pointer;\\n  display: inline-block !important;\\n  line-height: 42px;\\n  font-size: 16px;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  text-box-trim: none;\\n}\\n.button:active {\\n  transform: none;\\n}\\n\\nimg {\\n  max-width: 100%;\\n  height: auto;\\n}\\n\\na, a:link, a:visited, a:active, a:hover {\\n  text-decoration: underline;\\n  color: blue;\\n}\\n\\n.email-data-table {\\n  width: 100%;\\n  border-collapse: collapse;\\n}\\n.email-data-table th, .email-data-table td {\\n  text-align: left;\\n  padding: 10px 10px 10px 0;\\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border, var(--color-gray-2, #dcdcdc));\\n  vertical-align: middle;\\n}\\n.email-data-table th:last-child, .email-data-table td:last-child {\\n  text-align: right;\\n  padding-right: 0;\\n}\\n.email-data-table td.price {\\n  white-space: nowrap;\\n}\\n.email-data-table thead {\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n}\\n.email-data-table thead th {\\n  font-size: 10pt;\\n}\\n.email-data-table h4 ~ p {\\n  padding-top: 3px;\\n  opacity: 0.8;\\n  font-size: 11pt;\\n}\\n\\n.style-inline-code {\\n  font-family: monospace;\\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\\n  display: inline-block;\\n  letter-spacing: 1%;\\n}\\n\\n.style-code-large {\\n  font-family: monospace;\\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\\n  font-size: 16pt;\\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\\n  background: #f2f2f2;\\n  padding: 6px 10px;\\n  border-radius: 6px;\\n  display: inline-block;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-description-small {\\n  font-size: 14px;\\n  line-height: 1.5;\\n  font-weight: normal;\\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\\n  font-variation-settings: \\\"opsz\\\" 19;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-title-list {\\n  font-size: 16px;\\n  line-height: 1.3;\\n  font-weight: 500;\\n}\\n.email-style-title-list + p {\\n  padding-top: 3px;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-title-prefix-list {\\n  font-size: 11px;\\n  line-height: 1.5;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  color: {{primaryColor}};\\n  text-transform: uppercase;\\n  margin-bottom: 3px;\\n}\\n.email-style-title-prefix-list.error {\\n  color: #f0153d;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-price-base, .email-style-discount-price, .email-style-discount-old-price, .email-style-price {\\n  font-size: 15px;\\n  line-height: 1.4;\\n  font-weight: 500;\\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\\n}\\n.email-style-price-base.disabled, .disabled.email-style-discount-price, .disabled.email-style-discount-old-price, .disabled.email-style-price {\\n  opacity: 0.6;\\n}\\n.email-style-price-base.negative, .negative.email-style-discount-price, .negative.email-style-discount-old-price, .negative.email-style-price {\\n  color: #f0153d;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-price {\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  color: {{primaryColor}};\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-discount-old-price {\\n  text-decoration: line-through;\\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-discount-price {\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  color: #ff4747;\\n  margin-left: 5px;\\n}\\n\\n.pre-wrap {\\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\\n} hr {height: 2px;background: #e7e7e7; border-radius: 1px; padding: 0; margin: 20px 0; outline: none; border: 0;} .button.primary { margin: 0; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: {{primaryColorContrast}}; padding: 0 27px; line-height: 42px; background: {{primaryColor}}; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; touch-action: manipulation; display: inline-block; transition: 0.2s transform, 0.2s opacity; } .button.primary:active { transform: scale(0.95, 0.95); }  .inline-link, .inline-link:link, .inline-link:visited, .inline-link:active, .inline-link:hover { margin: 0; text-decoration: underline; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; color: inherit; touch-action: manipulation; } .inline-link:active { opacity: 0.5; }  .description { color: #5e5e5e; } </style>\\n</head>\\n\\n<body>\\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">{{greeting}}</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">You have a new outstanding amount of {{outstandingBalance}} at {{organizationName}}. You can settle the payment by going to the member portal. There you can also view the details of the outstanding amount.</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><strong>Please do not simply transfer money to our account, but always pay via the member portal.</strong></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><div data-type=\\\"smartButton\\\" data-id=\\\"paymentUrl\\\"><table width=\\\"100%\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"margin: 5px 0;\\\">\\n<tbody><tr>\\n    <td>\\n        <table cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\">\\n            <tbody><tr>\\n                <td style=\\\"border-radius: 7px;\\\" bgcolor=\\\"{{primaryColor}}\\\">\\n                <a class=\\\"button primary\\\" href=\\\"{{paymentUrl}}\\\" target=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: {{primaryColorContrast}}; padding: 0 27px; line-height: 42px; background: {{primaryColor}}; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; touch-action: manipulation; display: inline-block; transition: 0.2s transform, 0.2s opacity;\\\">Pay via the member portal</a>\\n                </td>\\n            </tr>\\n        </tbody></table>\\n    </td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody></table></div><p class=\\\"description\\\" style=\\\"color: #5e5e5e;\\\"><em>Not sure whether one of our emails is genuine? Then go directly to the member portal via our website without clicking a link in an email. There you can also view your outstanding amount and pay it if needed - that way you are always sure you are paying us and it is not phishing.</em></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p class=\\\"description\\\" style=\\\"color: #5e5e5e;\\\"><strong><em>Questions about your outstanding amount</em></strong><em>? Please contact </em>{{organizationName}} <em>via </em>{{fromAddress}}</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><hr style=\\\"height: 2px;background: #e7e7e7; border-radius: 1px; padding: 0; margin: 20px 0; outline: none; border: 0;\\\"><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><h2 style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0;\\\">Overview</h2><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">This is a snapshot of your current outstanding amount. You can go to the member portal at any time to view the current status and pay.</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><div data-type=\\\"smartVariableBlock\\\" data-id=\\\"balanceTable\\\">{{balanceTable}}</div><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p class=\\\"description\\\" style=\\\"color: #5e5e5e;\\\"><em>Did this email reach you, but you have no idea what it is about and think it was meant for someone else (e.g. a typo)? Then it is best to unsubscribe from our emails via </em><a class=\\\"inline-link\\\" href=\\\"{{unsubscribeUrl}}\\\" target=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0; text-decoration: underline; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; color: inherit; touch-action: manipulation;\\\"><em>this button</em></a><em> — after that you will never receive an email from us again.</em></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><a class=\\\"inline-link\\\" href=\\\"{{unsubscribeUrl}}\\\" target=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0; text-decoration: underline; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; color: inherit; touch-action: manipulation;\\\">Unsubscribe</a></p>\\n</body>\\n\\n</html>\",\"text\":\"{{greeting}}\\n\\nYou have a new outstanding amount of {{outstandingBalance}} at {{organizationName}}. You can settle the payment by going to the member portal. There you can also view the details of the outstanding amount.\\n\\nPlease do not simply transfer money to our account, but always pay via the member portal.\\n\\nPay via the member portal ({{paymentUrl}})\\n\\nNot sure whether one of our emails is genuine? Then go directly to the member portal via our website without clicking a link in an email. There you can also view your outstanding amount and pay it if needed - that way you are always sure you are paying us and it is not phishing.\\n\\nQuestions about your outstanding amount? Please contact {{organizationName}} via {{fromAddress}}\\n\\nOverview\\n\\nThis is a snapshot of your current outstanding amount. You can go to the member portal at any time to view the current status and pay.\\n\\n{{balanceTable}}\\n\\nDid this email reach you, but you have no idea what it is about and think it was meant for someone else (e.g. a typo)? Then it is best to unsubscribe from our emails via this button ({{unsubscribeUrl}}) — after that you will never receive an email from us again.\\nUnsubscribe ({{unsubscribeUrl}})\",\"json\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"greeting\"}}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"You have a new outstanding amount of \"},{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"outstandingBalance\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" at \"},{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"organizationName\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\". You can settle the payment by going to the member portal. There you can also view the details of the outstanding amount.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"text\":\"Please do not simply transfer money to our account, but always pay via the member portal.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"smartButton\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"paymentUrl\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Pay via the member portal\"}]},{\"type\":\"descriptiveText\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}],\"text\":\"Not sure whether one of our emails is genuine? Then go directly to the member portal via our website without clicking a link in an email. There you can also view your outstanding amount and pay it if needed - that way you are always sure you are paying us and it is not phishing.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"descriptiveText\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"},{\"type\":\"italic\"}],\"text\":\"Questions about your outstanding amount\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}],\"text\":\"? Please contact \"},{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"organizationName\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}],\"text\":\"via \"},{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"fromAddress\"}}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"horizontalRule\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"attrs\":{\"level\":2},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Overview\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"This is a snapshot of your current outstanding amount. You can go to the member portal at any time to view the current status and pay.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"smartVariableBlock\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"balanceTable\"}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"descriptiveText\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}],\"text\":\"Did this email reach you, but you have no idea what it is about and think it was meant for someone else (e.g. a typo)? Then it is best to unsubscribe from our emails via \"},{\"type\":\"smartButtonInline\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"unsubscribeUrl\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}],\"text\":\"this button\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}],\"text\":\" — after that you will never receive an email from us again.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"smartButtonInline\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"unsubscribeUrl\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Unsubscribe\"}]}]}]}}},\"version\":413}', 'nl'),
('36750548-905a-47a2-badb-ca01ca330eee', 'Je hebt al een account bij {{organizationName}}', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'SignupAlreadyHasAccount', '{{greeting}}Je probeerde om met {{email}} een account aan te maken bij {{organizationName}}, maar je hebt al een account met dit e-mailadres.Geen paniek, je kan heel makkelijk een nieuw wachtwoord instellen voor jouw account via de knop hieronder. Daarna kan je meteen inloggen bij {{organizationName}}.\n\n    \n        \n            \n                \n                Wachtwoord opnieuw instellen ({{resetUrl}})\n                \n            \n        \n    \n\n{{resetUrl}}', '<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0\" />\n<title>Je hebt al een account bij {{organizationName}}</title>\n<style type=\"text/css\">body {\n  color: #000716;\n  color: var(--color-dark, #000716);\n  font-family: -apple-system-body, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \"Apple Color Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Symbol\";\n  font-size: 12pt;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n\np {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n\np.description {\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\n}\np.description a, p.description a:link, p.description a:visited, p.description a:active, p.description a:hover {\n  text-decoration: underline;\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\n}\n\nstrong {\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n\nem {\n  font-style: italic;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 30px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n@media (max-width: 350px) {\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 24px;\n  }\n}\n\nh2 {\n  font-size: 20px;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nh3 {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nh4 {\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nol, ul {\n  list-style-position: outside;\n  padding-left: 30px;\n}\n\nhr {\n  height: 1px;\n  background: var(--color-border, var(--color-gray-2, #dcdcdc));\n  border-radius: 1px;\n  padding: 0;\n  margin: 20px 0;\n  outline: none;\n  border: 0;\n}\n\n.button {\n  touch-action: inherit;\n  user-select: auto;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  display: inline-block !important;\n  line-height: 42px;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n.button:active {\n  transform: none;\n}\n\nimg {\n  max-width: 100%;\n  height: auto;\n}\n\na, a:link, a:visited, a:active, a:hover {\n  text-decoration: underline;\n  color: blue;\n}\n\n.email-data-table {\n  width: 100%;\n  border-collapse: collapse;\n}\n.email-data-table th, .email-data-table td {\n  text-align: left;\n  padding: 10px 10px 10px 0;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border, var(--color-gray-2, #dcdcdc));\n  vertical-align: middle;\n}\n.email-data-table th:last-child, .email-data-table td:last-child {\n  text-align: right;\n  padding-right: 0;\n}\n.email-data-table thead {\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n.email-data-table thead th {\n  font-size: 10pt;\n}\n.email-data-table h4 ~ p {\n  padding-top: 3px;\n  opacity: 0.8;\n  font-size: 11pt;\n}\n\n.email-style-inline-code {\n  font-family: monospace;\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\n  display: inline-block;\n}\n\n.email-style-description-small {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  font-weight: normal;\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\n  font-variation-settings: \"opsz\" 19;\n}\n\n.email-style-title-list {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  line-height: 1.3;\n  font-weight: 500;\n}\n.email-style-title-list + p {\n  padding-top: 3px;\n}\n\n.email-style-title-prefix-list {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  color: {{primaryColor}};\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  margin-bottom: 3px;\n}\n.email-style-title-prefix-list.error {\n  color: #f0153d;\n}\n\n.email-style-price-base, .email-style-discount-price, .email-style-discount-old-price, .email-style-price {\n  font-size: 15px;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n}\n.email-style-price-base.disabled, .disabled.email-style-discount-price, .disabled.email-style-discount-old-price, .disabled.email-style-price {\n  opacity: 0.6;\n}\n.email-style-price-base.negative, .negative.email-style-discount-price, .negative.email-style-discount-old-price, .negative.email-style-price {\n  color: #f0153d;\n}\n\n.email-style-price {\n  font-weight: bold;\n  color: {{primaryColor}};\n}\n\n.email-style-discount-old-price {\n  text-decoration: line-through;\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\n}\n\n.email-style-discount-price {\n  font-weight: bold;\n  color: #ff4747;\n  margin-left: 5px;\n}\n\n.pre-wrap {\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\n} hr {height: 2px;background: #e7e7e7; border-radius: 1px; padding: 0; margin: 20px 0; outline: none; border: 0;} .button.primary { margin: 0; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: {{primaryColorContrast}}; padding: 0 27px; line-height: 42px; background: {{primaryColor}}; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; touch-action: manipulation; display: inline-block; transition: 0.2s transform, 0.2s opacity; } .button.primary:active { transform: scale(0.95, 0.95); }  .inline-link, .inline-link:link, .inline-link:visited, .inline-link:active, .inline-link:hover { margin: 0; text-decoration: underline; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; color: inherit; touch-action: manipulation; } .inline-link:active { opacity: 0.5; }  .description { color: #5e5e5e; } </style>\n</head>\n\n<body>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\">{{greeting}}</p><p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\">Je probeerde om met {{email}} een account aan te maken bij {{organizationName}}, maar je hebt al een account met dit e-mailadres.</p><p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\"><br>Geen paniek, je kan heel makkelijk een nieuw wachtwoord instellen voor jouw account via de knop hieronder. Daarna kan je meteen inloggen bij {{organizationName}}.</p><p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\"><br></p><div data-type=\"smartButton\" data-id=\"resetUrl\"><table width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"margin: 5px 0;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n    <td>\n        <table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n            <tbody><tr>\n                <td style=\"border-radius: 7px;\" bgcolor=\"{{primaryColor}}\">\n                <a class=\"button primary\" href=\"{{resetUrl}}\" target=\"\" style=\"margin: 0; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: {{primaryColorContrast}}; padding: 0 27px; line-height: 42px; background: {{primaryColor}}; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; touch-action: manipulation; display: inline-block; transition: 0.2s transform, 0.2s opacity;\">Wachtwoord opnieuw instellen</a>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </tbody></table>\n    </td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div><p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\">{{resetUrl}}</p><p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\"><br></p>\n</body>\n\n</html>', '{\"value\": {\"type\": \"doc\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"paragraph\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"smartVariable\", \"attrs\": {\"id\": \"greeting\"}}]}, {\"type\": \"paragraph\"}, {\"type\": \"paragraph\", \"content\": [{\"text\": \"Je probeerde om met \", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"type\": \"smartVariable\", \"attrs\": {\"id\": \"email\"}}, {\"text\": \" een account aan te maken bij \", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"type\": \"smartVariable\", \"attrs\": {\"id\": \"organizationName\"}}, {\"text\": \", maar je hebt al een account met dit e-mailadres.\", \"type\": \"text\"}]}, {\"type\": \"paragraph\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"hardBreak\"}, {\"text\": \"Geen paniek, je kan heel makkelijk een nieuw wachtwoord instellen voor jouw account via de knop hieronder. Daarna kan je meteen inloggen bij \", \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"type\": \"smartVariable\", \"attrs\": {\"id\": \"organizationName\"}}, {\"text\": \".\", \"type\": \"text\"}]}, {\"type\": \"paragraph\"}, {\"type\": \"smartButton\", \"attrs\": {\"id\": \"resetUrl\"}, \"content\": [{\"text\": \"Wachtwoord opnieuw instellen\", \"type\": \"text\"}]}, {\"type\": \"paragraph\", \"content\": [{\"type\": \"smartVariable\", \"attrs\": {\"id\": \"resetUrl\"}}]}, {\"type\": \"paragraph\"}]}, \"version\": 377}', '2025-07-15 09:15:54', '2025-07-15 09:15:54', '{\"value\":{\"fr\":{\"subject\":\"Vous avez déjà un compte chez {{organizationName}}\",\"html\":\"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html>\\n\\n<head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n<meta http-equiv=\\\"X-UA-Compatible\\\" content=\\\"IE=edge\\\" />\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n<title>Vous avez déjà un compte chez {{organizationName}}</title>\\n<style type=\\\"text/css\\\">body {\\n  color: #000716;\\n  color: var(--color-dark, #000716);\\n  font-family: -apple-system-body, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\";\\n  font-size: 12pt;\\n  line-height: 1.4;\\n}\\n\\np {\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n  line-height: 1.4;\\n}\\n\\np.description {\\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\\n  font-size: 10pt;\\n}\\np.description a, p.description a:link, p.description a:visited, p.description a:active, p.description a:hover {\\n  text-decoration: underline;\\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\\n}\\n\\nstrong {\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n}\\n\\nem {\\n  font-style: italic;\\n}\\n\\nh1 {\\n  font-size: 30px;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  line-height: 1.2;\\n}\\n@media (max-width: 350px) {\\n  h1 {\\n    font-size: 24px;\\n  }\\n}\\nh1 {\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n}\\n\\nh2 {\\n  font-size: 20px;\\n  line-height: 1.2;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n}\\n\\nh3 {\\n  font-size: 16px;\\n  line-height: 1.2;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n}\\n\\nh4 {\\n  line-height: 1.2;\\n  font-weight: 500;\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n}\\n\\nol, ul {\\n  list-style-position: outside;\\n  padding-left: 30px;\\n}\\n\\nhr {\\n  height: 1px;\\n  background: var(--color-border, var(--color-gray-2, #dcdcdc));\\n  border-radius: 1px;\\n  padding: 0;\\n  margin: 20px 0;\\n  outline: none;\\n  border: 0;\\n}\\n\\n.button {\\n  touch-action: inherit;\\n  user-select: auto;\\n  cursor: pointer;\\n  display: inline-block !important;\\n  line-height: 42px;\\n  font-size: 16px;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  text-box-trim: none;\\n}\\n.button:active {\\n  transform: none;\\n}\\n\\nimg {\\n  max-width: 100%;\\n  height: auto;\\n}\\n\\na, a:link, a:visited, a:active, a:hover {\\n  text-decoration: underline;\\n  color: blue;\\n}\\n\\n.email-data-table {\\n  width: 100%;\\n  border-collapse: collapse;\\n}\\n.email-data-table th, .email-data-table td {\\n  text-align: left;\\n  padding: 10px 10px 10px 0;\\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border, var(--color-gray-2, #dcdcdc));\\n  vertical-align: middle;\\n}\\n.email-data-table th:last-child, .email-data-table td:last-child {\\n  text-align: right;\\n  padding-right: 0;\\n}\\n.email-data-table td.price {\\n  white-space: nowrap;\\n}\\n.email-data-table thead {\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n}\\n.email-data-table thead th {\\n  font-size: 10pt;\\n}\\n.email-data-table h4 ~ p {\\n  padding-top: 3px;\\n  opacity: 0.8;\\n  font-size: 11pt;\\n}\\n\\n.style-inline-code {\\n  font-family: monospace;\\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\\n  display: inline-block;\\n  letter-spacing: 1%;\\n}\\n\\n.style-code-large {\\n  font-family: monospace;\\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\\n  font-size: 16pt;\\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\\n  background: #f2f2f2;\\n  padding: 6px 10px;\\n  border-radius: 6px;\\n  display: inline-block;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-description-small {\\n  font-size: 14px;\\n  line-height: 1.5;\\n  font-weight: normal;\\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\\n  font-variation-settings: \\\"opsz\\\" 19;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-title-list {\\n  font-size: 16px;\\n  line-height: 1.3;\\n  font-weight: 500;\\n}\\n.email-style-title-list + p {\\n  padding-top: 3px;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-title-prefix-list {\\n  font-size: 11px;\\n  line-height: 1.5;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  color: {{primaryColor}};\\n  text-transform: uppercase;\\n  margin-bottom: 3px;\\n}\\n.email-style-title-prefix-list.error {\\n  color: #f0153d;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-price-base, .email-style-discount-price, .email-style-discount-old-price, .email-style-price {\\n  font-size: 15px;\\n  line-height: 1.4;\\n  font-weight: 500;\\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\\n}\\n.email-style-price-base.disabled, .disabled.email-style-discount-price, .disabled.email-style-discount-old-price, .disabled.email-style-price {\\n  opacity: 0.6;\\n}\\n.email-style-price-base.negative, .negative.email-style-discount-price, .negative.email-style-discount-old-price, .negative.email-style-price {\\n  color: #f0153d;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-price {\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  color: {{primaryColor}};\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-discount-old-price {\\n  text-decoration: line-through;\\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-discount-price {\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  color: #ff4747;\\n  margin-left: 5px;\\n}\\n\\n.pre-wrap {\\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\\n} hr {height: 2px;background: #e7e7e7; border-radius: 1px; padding: 0; margin: 20px 0; outline: none; border: 0;} .button.primary { margin: 0; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: {{primaryColorContrast}}; padding: 0 27px; line-height: 42px; background: {{primaryColor}}; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; touch-action: manipulation; display: inline-block; transition: 0.2s transform, 0.2s opacity; } .button.primary:active { transform: scale(0.95, 0.95); }  .inline-link, .inline-link:link, .inline-link:visited, .inline-link:active, .inline-link:hover { margin: 0; text-decoration: underline; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; color: inherit; touch-action: manipulation; } .inline-link:active { opacity: 0.5; }  .description { color: #5e5e5e; } </style>\\n</head>\\n\\n<body>\\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">{{greeting}}</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">Vous avez essayé de créer un compte avec {{email}} chez {{organizationName}}, mais vous avez déjà un compte avec cette adresse e-mail.</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br>Pas de panique, vous pouvez très facilement définir un nouveau mot de passe pour votre compte via le bouton ci-dessous. Vous pourrez ensuite vous connecter directement à {{organizationName}}.</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><div data-type=\\\"smartButton\\\" data-id=\\\"resetUrl\\\"><table width=\\\"100%\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"margin: 5px 0;\\\">\\n<tbody><tr>\\n    <td>\\n        <table cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\">\\n            <tbody><tr>\\n                <td style=\\\"border-radius: 7px;\\\" bgcolor=\\\"{{primaryColor}}\\\">\\n                <a class=\\\"button primary\\\" href=\\\"{{resetUrl}}\\\" target=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: {{primaryColorContrast}}; padding: 0 27px; line-height: 42px; background: {{primaryColor}}; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; touch-action: manipulation; display: inline-block; transition: 0.2s transform, 0.2s opacity;\\\">Réinitialiser le mot de passe</a>\\n                </td>\\n            </tr>\\n        </tbody></table>\\n    </td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody></table></div><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">{{resetUrl}}</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height