('6a2afe44-819f-4bd6-819d-91ea2c22b9cd', 'Proefperiode ledenadministratie vervallen', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'OrganizationDripMembersTrialExpired', '{{greeting}}Helaas is de ledenadministratie proefperiode voor {{organizationName}} vervallen. Heb je nog niet voldoende tijd gehad om alles uit te proberen, dan kan je de proefperiode opnieuw opstarten via de site. Als jullie vragen hebben, hoor ik het graag.— SimonOprichter {{platformName}}hallo@stamhoofd.be (mailto:hallo@stamhoofd.be)', '<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0\" />\n<title>Proefperiode ledenadministratie vervallen</title>\n<style type=\"text/css\">body {\n  color: #000716;\n  color: var(--color-dark, #000716);\n  font-family: -apple-system-body, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \"Apple Color Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Symbol\";\n  font-size: 12pt;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n\np {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n\np.description {\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\n}\np.description a, p.description a:link, p.description a:visited, p.description a:active, p.description a:hover {\n  text-decoration: underline;\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\n}\n\nstrong {\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n\nem {\n  font-style: italic;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 30px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n@media (max-width: 350px) {\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 24px;\n  }\n}\n\nh2 {\n  font-size: 20px;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nh3 {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nh4 {\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nol, ul {\n  list-style-position: outside;\n  padding-left: 30px;\n}\n\nhr {\n  height: 1px;\n 