nherit; touch-action: manipulation; } .inline-link:active { opacity: 0.5; }  .description { color: #5e5e5e; } </style>\\n</head>\\n\\n<body>\\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">Hi {{firstName}},</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">On {{validUntil}} the trial period of {{organizationName}} for webshops/ticket sales at {{platformName}} ends. You can buy the package (choice between two months or one year) if you want to keep using it.</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">You can buy via the button below, or by going to the {{platformName}} app/website and selecting the packages you want to buy under settings &gt; \'My packages\'. </p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><div data-type=\\\"smartButton\\\" data-id=\\\"renewUrl\\\"><table width=\\\"100%\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"margin: 5px 0;\\\">\\n<tbody><tr>\\n    <td>\\n        <table cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\">\\n            <tbody><tr>\\n                <td style=\\\"border-radius: 7px;\\\" bgcolor=\\\"{{primaryColor}}\\\">\\n                <a class=\\\"button primary\\\" href=\\\"{{renewUrl}}\\\" target=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: {{primaryColorContrast}}; padding: 0 27px; line-height: 42px; background: {{primaryColor}}; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; touch-action: manipulation; display: inline-block; transition: 0.2s transform, 0.2s opacity;\\\">Buy webshops</a>\\n                </td>\\n            </tr>\\n        </tbody></table>\\n    </td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody></table></div><p class=\\\"description\\\" style=\\\"color: #5e5e5e;\\\"><em>Click the button above to go directly to the settings to buy the package. If you are not logged in yet, you will have to log in first.</em></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><hr style=\\\"height: 2px;background: #e7e7e7; border-radius: 1px; padding: 0; margin: 20px 0; outline: none; border: 0;\\\"><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><h2 style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0;\\\">Frequently asked questions</h2><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><ul><li><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><strong>Already bought the package? </strong>No worries: in that case you can safely ignore this email as long as you can see in the {{platformName}} settings that the package is valid until the correct date.</p></li><li><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><strong>Can I keep using the webshops I created after buying the package? </strong>Yes, you can keep all webshops. You can delete any test orders.</p></li><li><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><strong>Where can I find information about the prices? </strong>On <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"https://www.stamhoofd.be/prijzen\\\">https://www.stamhoofd.be/prijzen</a> you will find all the information.</p></li></ul><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><hr style=\\\"height: 2px;background: #e7e7e7; border-radius: 1px; padding: 0; margin: 20px 0; outline: none; border: 0;\\\"><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">Feel free to let us know if you have any further questions. We will be happy to answer them.</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">Kind regards,</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">{{platformName}}</p>\\n</body>\\n\\n</html>\",\"text\":\"Hi {{firstName}},\\n\\nOn {{validUntil}} the trial period of {{organizationName}} for webshops/ticket sales at {{platformName}} ends. You can buy the package (choice between two months or one year) if you want to keep using it.\\n\\nYou can buy via the button below, or by going to the {{platformName}} app/website and selecting the packages you want to buy under settings > \'My packages\'. \\n\\nBuy webshops ({{renewUrl}})\\n\\nClick the button above to go directly to the settings to buy the package. If you are not logged in yet, you will have to log in first.\\n\\nFrequently asked questions\\n\\nAlready bought the package? No worries: in that case you can safely ignore this email as long as you can see in the {{platformName}} settings that the package is valid until the correct date.\\nCan I keep using the webshops I created after buying the package? Yes, you can keep all webshops. You can delete any test orders.\\nWhere can I find information about the prices? On https://www.stamhoofd.be/prijzen (https://www.stamhoofd.be/prijzen) you will find all the information.\\n\\nFeel free to let us know if you have any further questions. We will be happy to answer them.\\n\\nKind regards,\\n{{platformName}}\",\"json\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Hi \"},{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"firstName\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\",\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"On \"},{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"validUntil\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" the trial period of \"},{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"organizationName\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" for webshops/ticket sales at {{platformName}} ends. You can buy the package (choice between two months or one year) if you want to keep using it.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"You can buy via the button below, or by going to the {{platformName}} app/website and selecting the packages you want to buy under settings > \'My packages\'. \"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"smartButton\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"renewUrl\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Buy webshops\"}]},{\"type\":\"descriptiveText\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}],\"text\":\"Click the button above to go directly to the settings to buy the package. If you are not logged in yet, you will have to log in first.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"horizontalRule\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"attrs\":{\"level\":2},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Frequently asked questions\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"text\":\"Already bought the package? \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"No worries: in that case you can safely ignore this email as long as you can see in the {{platformName}} settings that the package is valid until the correct date.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"text\":\"Can I keep using the webshops I created after buying the package? \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Yes, you can keep all webshops. You can delete any test orders.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"text\":\"Where can I find information about the prices? \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"On \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"href\":\"https://www.stamhoofd.be/prijzen\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"class\":null,\"title\":null}}],\"text\":\"https://www.stamhoofd.be/prijzen\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" you will find all the information.\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"horizontalRule\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Feel free to let us know if you have any further questions. We will be happy to answer them.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Kind regards,\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{{platformName}}\"}]}]}}},\"version\":413}', 'nl'),
('7b28fe12-d06e-49d0-9acf-102a1873253a', 'Kampmelding voor {{eventName}} ({{dateRange}}) werd voorlopig goedgekeurd', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'EventNotificationPartiallyAccepted', '{{greeting}}Goed nieuws! Jullie kampmelding voor  {{eventName}} ({{dateRange}}) van {{organizationName}} werd voorlopig goedgekeurd. Deze werd ingediend door {{submitterName}}.\n\n    \n        \n            \n                \n                Kampmelding bekijken ({{reviewUrl}})\n                \n            \n        \n    \n\nOpmerkingen{{feedbackText}}', '<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0\" />\n<title>Kampmelding voor {{eventName}} ({{dateRange}}) werd voorlopig goedgekeurd</title>\n<style type=\"text/css\">body {\n  color: #000716;\n  color: var(--color-dark, #000716);\n  font-family: -apple-system-body, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \"Apple Color Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Symbol\";\n  font-size: 12pt;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n\np {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n\np.description {\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\n}\np.description a, p.description a:link, p.description a:visited, p.description a:active, p.description a:hover {\n  text-decoration: underline;\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\n}\n\nstrong {\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n\nem {\n  font-style: italic;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 30px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n@media (max-width: 350px) {\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 24px;\n  }\n}\n\nh2 {\n  font-size: 20px;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nh3 {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nh4 {\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nol, ul {\n  list-style-position: outside;\n  padding-left: 30px;\n}\n\nhr {\n  height: 1px;\n  background: var(--color-border, var(--color-gray-2, #dcdcdc));\n  border-radius: 1px;\n  padding: 0;\n  margin: 20px 0;\n  outline: none;\n  border: 0;\n}\n\n.button {\n  touch-action: inherit;\n  user-select: auto;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  display: inline-block !important;\n  line-height: 42px;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n.button:active {\n  transform: none;\n}\n\nimg {\n  max-width: 100%;\n  height: auto;\n}\n\na, a:link, a:visited, a:active, a:hover {\n  text-decoration: underline;\n  color: blue;\n}\n\n.email-data-table {\n  width: 100%;\n  border-collapse: collapse;\n}\n.email-data-table th, .email-data-table td {\n  text-align: left;\n  padding: 10px 10px 10px 0;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border, var(--color-gray-2, #dcdcdc));\n  vertical-align: middle;\n}\n.email-data-table th:last-child, .email-data-table td:last-child {\n  text-align: right;\n  padding-right: 0;\n}\n.email-data-table thead {\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n.email-data-table thead th {\n  font-size: 10pt;\n}\n.email-data-table h4 ~ p {\n  padding-top: 3px;\n  opacity: 0.8;\n  font-size: 11pt;\n}\n\n.email-style-inline-code {\n  font-family: monospace;\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\n  display: inline-block;\n}\n\n.email-style-description-small {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  font-weight: normal;\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\n  font-variation-settings: \"opsz\" 19;\n}\n\n.email-style-title-list {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  line-height: 1.3;\n  font-weight: 500;\n}\n.email-style-title-list + p {\n  padding-top: 3px;\n}\n\n.email-style-title-prefix-list {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  color: {{primaryColor}};\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  margin-bottom: 3px;\n}\n.email-style-title-prefix-list.error {\n  color: #f0153d;\n}\n\n.email-style-price-base, .email-style-discount-price, .email-style-discount-old-price, .email-style-price {\n  font-size: 15px;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n}\n.email-style-price-base.disabled, .disabled.email-style-discount-price, .disabled.email-style-discount-old-price, .disabled.email-style-price {\n  opacity: 0.6;\n}\n.email-style-price-base.negative, .negative.email-style-discount-price, .negative.email-style-discount-old-price, .negative.email-style-price {\n  color: #f0153d;\n}\n\n.email-style-price {\n  font-weight: bold;\n  color: {{primaryColor}};\n}\n\n.email-style-discount-old-price {\n  text-decoration: line-through;\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\n}\n\n.email-style-discount-price {\n  font-weight: bold;\n  color: #ff4747;\n  margin-left: 5px;\n}\n\n.pre-wrap {\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\n} hr {height: 2px;background: #e7e7e7; border-radius: 1px; padding: 0; margin: 20px 0; outline: none; border: 0;} .button.primary { margin: 0; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: {{primaryColorContrast}}; padding: 0 27px; line-height: 42px; background: {{primaryColor}}; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; touch-action: manipulation; display: inline-block; transition: 0.2s transform, 0.2s opacity; } .button.primary:active { transform: scale(0.95, 0.95); }  .inline-link, .inline-link:link, .inline-link:visited, .inline-link:active, .inline-link:hover { margin: 0; text-decoration: underline; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; color: inherit; touch-action: manipulation; } .inline-link:active { opacity: 0.5; }  .description { color: #5e5e5e; } </style>\n</head>\n\n<body>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\">{{greeting}}</p><p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\"><br></p><p style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\">Goed nieuws! Jullie kampmelding voor  <strong>{{eventName}}</strong> ({{dateRange}}) van <strong>{{organizationName}}</strong> werd voorlopig goedgekeurd. Deze werd ingediend door {{submitterName}}.</p><p style=\"margin: 0; paddin