.inline-link:hover { margin: 0; text-decoration: underline; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; color: inherit; touch-action: manipulation; } .inline-link:active { opacity: 0.5; }  .description { color: #5e5e5e; } </style>\\n</head>\\n\\n<body>\\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">Hello!</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">We hereby confirm the registration of <strong>{{firstNameMember}}</strong> <strong>{{lastNameMember}} </strong>for <strong>{{groupName}} </strong>at<strong> {{organizationName}}</strong>.</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">You can manage all registrations, data and payments via the member portal of {{organizationName}} via the button below.</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><div data-type=\\\"smartButton\\\" data-id=\\\"signInUrl\\\"><table width=\\\"100%\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"margin: 5px 0;\\\">\\n<tbody><tr>\\n    <td>\\n        <table cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\">\\n            <tbody><tr>\\n                <td style=\\\"border-radius: 7px;\\\" bgcolor=\\\"{{primaryColor}}\\\">\\n                <a class=\\\"button primary\\\" href=\\\"{{signInUrl}}\\\" target=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: {{primaryColorContrast}}; padding: 0 27px; line-height: 42px; background: {{primaryColor}}; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; touch-action: manipulation; display: inline-block; transition: 0.2s transform, 0.2s opacity;\\\">Open member portal</a>\\n                </td>\\n            </tr>\\n        </tbody></table>\\n    </td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody></table></div><div data-type=\\\"smartVariableBlock\\\" data-id=\\\"loginDetails\\\">{{loginDetails}}</div><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">Kind regards,</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">{{organizationName}}</p><hr style=\\\"height: 2px;background: #e7e7e7; border-radius: 1px; padding: 0; margin: 20px 0; outline: none; border: 0;\\\"><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><strong>Our member administration is powered by </strong><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"https://www.stamhoofd.be/ledenadministratie\\\"><strong>{{platformName}}</strong></a></p><hr style=\\\"height: 2px;background: #e7e7e7; border-radius: 1px; padding: 0; margin: 20px 0; outline: none; border: 0;\\\"><p class=\\\"description\\\" style=\\\"color: #5e5e5e;\\\"><em>You receive this email because your email address is linked to a member in the member administration of {{organizationName}}. You can unsubscribe from all our emails via this link: </em><a class=\\\"inline-link\\\" href=\\\"{{unsubscribeUrl}}\\\" target=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0; text-decoration: underline; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; color: inherit; touch-action: manipulation;\\\"><em>Unsubscribe</em></a></p>\\n</body>\\n\\n</html>\",\"text\":\"Hello!\\n\\nWe hereby confirm the registration of {{firstNameMember}} {{lastNameMember}} for {{groupName}} at {{organizationName}}.\\n\\nYou can manage all registrations, data and payments via the member portal of {{organizationName}} via the button below.\\n\\nOpen member portal ({{signInUrl}})\\n\\n{{loginDetails}}\\nKind regards,\\n{{organizationName}}\\n\\nOur member administration is powered by {{platformName}} (https://www.stamhoofd.be/ledenadministratie)\\n\\nYou receive this email because your email address is linked to a member in the member administration of {{organizationName}}. You can unsubscribe from all our emails via this link: Unsubscribe ({{unsubscribeUrl}})\",\"json\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Hello!\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"We hereby confirm the registration of \"},{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"firstNameMember\"},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"lastNameMember\"},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"for \"},{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"groupName\"},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"at\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"organizationName\"},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\".\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"You can manage all registrations, data and payments via the member portal of \"},{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"organizationName\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" via the button below.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"smartButton\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"signInUrl\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Open member portal\"}]},{\"type\":\"smartVariableBlock\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"loginDetails\"}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Kind regards,\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"organizationName\"}}]},{\"type\":\"horizontalRule\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"text\":\"Our member administration is powered by \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"href\":\"https://www.stamhoofd.be/ledenadministratie\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer no