r></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">We have received the payment for order {{nr}}. You can now download your tickets via the button below.</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><div data-type=\\\"smartButton\\\" data-id=\\\"orderUrl\\\"><table width=\\\"100%\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"margin: 5px 0;\\\">\\n<tbody><tr>\\n    <td>\\n        <table cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\">\\n            <tbody><tr>\\n                <td style=\\\"border-radius: 7px;\\\" bgcolor=\\\"{{primaryColor}}\\\">\\n                <a class=\\\"button primary\\\" href=\\\"{{orderUrl}}\\\" target=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: {{primaryColorContrast}}; padding: 0 27px; line-height: 42px; background: {{primaryColor}}; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; touch-action: manipulation; display: inline-block; transition: 0.2s transform, 0.2s opacity;\\\">Download tickets</a>\\n                </td>\\n            </tr>\\n        </tbody></table>\\n    </td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody></table></div><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">Kind regards,</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">{{organizationName}}</p><hr style=\\\"height: 2px;background: #e7e7e7; border-radius: 1px; padding: 0; margin: 20px 0; outline: none; border: 0;\\\"><h2 style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0;\\\">Overview</h2><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><strong>ATTENTION: this email is not a valid ticket! Download the tickets via the button at the top.</strong></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><div data-type=\\\"smartVariableBlock\\\" data-id=\\\"orderDetailsTable\\\">{{orderDetailsTable}}</div><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><div data-type=\\\"smartVariableBlock\\\" data-id=\\\"orderTable\\\">{{orderTable}}</div><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><h3 style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0;\\\">Total {{orderPrice}}</h3><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><hr style=\\\"height: 2px;background: #e7e7e7; border-radius: 1px; padding: 0; margin: 20px 0; outline: none; border: 0;\\\"><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><strong>Organise a ticket sale for your association too via </strong><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" href=\\\"https://www.stamhoofd.be/ticketverkoop\\\"><strong>{{platformName}}</strong></a></p><hr style=\\\"height: 2px;background: #e7e7e7; border-radius: 1px; padding: 0; margin: 20px 0; outline: none; border: 0;\\\"><div data-type=\\\"smartButton\\\" data-id=\\\"orderUrl\\\"><table width=\\\"100%\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" style=\\\"margin: 5px 0;\\\">\\n<tbody><tr>\\n    <td>\\n        <table cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\">\\n            <tbody><tr>\\n                <td style=\\\"border-radius: 7px;\\\" bgcolor=\\\"{{primaryColor}}\\\">\\n                <a class=\\\"button primary\\\" href=\\\"{{orderUrl}}\\\" target=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: {{primaryColorContrast}}; padding: 0 27px; line-height: 42px; background: {{primaryColor}}; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; touch-action: manipulation; display: inline-block; transition: 0.2s transform, 0.2s opacity;\\\">Check order</a>\\n                </td>\\n            </tr>\\n        </tbody></table>\\n    </td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody></table></div><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p class=\\\"description\\\" style=\\\"color: #5e5e5e;\\\"><em>Via the button above you can check the details of your order and download your tickets.</em></p>\\n</body>\\n\\n</html>\",\"text\":\"Hi {{firstName}},\\n\\nWe have received the payment for order {{nr}}. You can now download your tickets via the button below.\\n\\nDownload tickets ({{orderUrl}})\\n\\nKind regards,\\n{{organizationName}}\\n\\nOverview\\n\\nATTENTION: this email is not a valid ticket! Download the tickets via the button at the top.\\n\\n{{orderDetailsTable}}\\n\\n{{orderTable}}\\nTotal {{orderPrice}}\\n\\nOrganise a ticket sale for your association too via {{platformName}} (https://www.stamhoofd.be/ticketverkoop)\\n\\nCheck order ({{orderUrl}})\\n\\nVia the button above you can check the details of your order and download your tickets.\",\"json\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Hi \"},{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"firstName\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\",\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"We have received the payment for order \"},{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"nr\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\". You can now download your tickets via the button below.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"smartButton\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"orderUrl\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Download tickets\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Kind regards,\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"organizationName\"}}]},{\"type\":\"horizontalRule\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"attrs\":{\"level\":2},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Overview\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"text\":\"ATTENTION: this email is not a valid ticket! Download the tickets via the button at the top.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"smartVariableBlock\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"orderDetailsTable\"}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"smartVariableBlock\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"orderTable\"}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"heading\",\"attrs\":{\"level\":3},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Total \"},{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"orderPrice\"}}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"horizontalRule\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"text\":\"Organise a ticket sale for your association too via \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"href\":\"https://www.stamhoofd.be/ticketverkoop\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"class\":null,\"title\":null}},{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"text\":\"{{platformName}}\"}]},{\"type\":\"horizontalRule\"},{\"type\":\"smartButton\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"orderUrl\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Check order\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"descriptiveText\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}],\"text\":\"Via the button above you can check the details of your order and download your tickets.\"}]}]}}},\"version\":413}', 'nl'),
('a68a2059-98e2-4e31-bf5d-6ce6515e4b54', 'Wachtwoord van {{organizationName}} vergeten', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ForgotPassword', 'Hey {{firstName}},Je gaf aan dat je jouw wachtwoord bent vergeten bij {{organizationName}}. Je kan een nieuw wachtwoord instellen door op de volgende knop te klikken of door de link onderaan te kopiëren en plakken in de adresbalk van je browser:\n\n    \n        \n            \n                \n                Wachtwoord opnieuw instellen ({{resetUrl}})\n                \n            \n        \n    \n\n{{resetUrl}}Wachtwoord al teruggevonden of heb je helemaal niet aangeduid dat je je wachtwoord vergeten bent? Dan mag je deze e-mail gewoon negeren.{{organizationName}}', '<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0\" />\n<title>Wachtwoord van {{organizationName}} vergeten</title>\n<style type=\"text/css\">body {\n  color: #000716;\n  color: var(--color-dark, #000716);\n  font-family: -apple-system-body, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \"Apple Color Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Symbol\";\n  font-size: 12pt;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n\np {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n\np.description {\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\n}\np.description a, p.description a:link, p.description a:visited, p.description a:active, p.description a:hover {\n  text-decoration: underline;\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\n}\n\nstrong {\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n\nem {\n  font-style: italic;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 30px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n@media (max-width: 350px) {\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 24px;\n  }\n}\n\nh2 {\n  font-size: 20px;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nh3 {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  font-we