font-size: 15px;\\n  line-height: 1.4;\\n  font-weight: 500;\\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\\n}\\n.email-style-price-base.disabled, .disabled.email-style-discount-price, .disabled.email-style-discount-old-price, .disabled.email-style-price {\\n  opacity: 0.6;\\n}\\n.email-style-price-base.negative, .negative.email-style-discount-price, .negative.email-style-discount-old-price, .negative.email-style-price {\\n  color: #f0153d;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-price {\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  color: {{primaryColor}};\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-discount-old-price {\\n  text-decoration: line-through;\\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-discount-price {\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  color: #ff4747;\\n  margin-left: 5px;\\n}\\n\\n.pre-wrap {\\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\\n} hr {height: 2px;background: #e7e7e7; border-radius: 1px; padding: 0; margin: 20px 0; outline: none; border: 0;} .button.primary { margin: 0; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: {{primaryColorContrast}}; padding: 0 27px; line-height: 42px; background: {{primaryColor}}; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; touch-action: manipulation; display: inline-block; transition: 0.2s transform, 0.2s opacity; } .button.primary:active { transform: scale(0.95, 0.95); }  .inline-link, .inline-link:link, .inline-link:visited, .inline-link:active, .inline-link:hover { margin: 0; text-decoration: underline; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; color: inherit; touch-action: manipulation; } .inline-link:active { opacity: 0.5; }  .description { color: #5e5e5e; } </style>\\n</head>\\n\\n<body>\\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">{{greeting}}</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">Ceci est un e-mail technique destiné à votre webmaster.</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">{{platformName}} vérifie chaque jour automatiquement si votre nom de domaine {{mailDomain}}, qui est connecté à {{organizationName}} sur {{platformName}}, est toujours correctement configuré. Cela est nécessaire pour l\'envoi d\'e-mails via vos adresses e-mail, mais aussi éventuellement pour votre portail des membres si vous utilisez l\'administration des membres.</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">Depuis quelque temps, nous constatons que votre nom de domaine est correctement configuré à un moment donné, puis plus le lendemain, et ainsi de suite. Pour éviter que vous receviez chaque fois un e-mail de notre part à ce sujet, nous avons marqué votre adresse e-mail comme instable.</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">Vérifiez que les serveurs de noms de votre nom de domaine sont correctement configurés et renvoient tous les mêmes enregistrements DNS.</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">Vous recevrez à nouveau un e-mail de notre part lorsque nous constaterons que le problème a été résolu. N\'hésitez pas à nous contacter si vous avez des questions à ce sujet.</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">{{platformName}}</p>\\n</body>\\n\\n</html>\",\"text\":\"{{greeting}}\\n\\nCeci est un e-mail technique destiné à votre webmaster.\\n\\n{{platformName}} vérifie chaque jour automatiquement si votre nom de domaine {{mailDomain}}, qui est connecté à {{organizationName}} sur {{platformName}}, est toujours correctement configuré. Cela est nécessaire pour l\'envoi d\'e-mails via vos adresses e-mail, mais aussi éventuellement pour votre portail des membres si vous utilisez l\'administration des membres.\\n\\nDepuis quelque temps, nous constatons que votre nom de domaine est correctement configuré à un moment donné, puis plus le lendemain, et ainsi de suite. Pour éviter que vous receviez chaque fois un e-mail de notre part à ce sujet, nous avons marqué votre adresse e-mail comme instable.\\n\\nVérifiez que les serveurs de noms de votre nom de domaine sont correctement configurés et renvoient tous les mêmes enregistrements DNS.\\n\\nVous recevrez à nouveau un e-mail de notre part lorsque nous constaterons que le problème a été résolu. N\'hésitez pas à nous contacter si vous avez des questions à ce sujet.\\n\\n{{platformName}}\",\"json\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"greeting\"}}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Ceci est un e-mail technique destiné à votre webmaster.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{{platformName}} vérifie chaque jour automatiquement si votre nom de domaine \"},{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"mailDomain\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\", qui est connecté à \"},{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"organizationName\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" sur {{platformName}}, est toujours correctement configuré. Cela est nécessaire pour l\'envoi d\'e-mails via vos adresses e-mail, mais aussi éventuellement pour votre portail des membres si vous utilisez l\'administration des membres.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Depuis quelque temps, nous constatons que votre nom de domaine est correctement configuré à un moment donné, puis plus le lendemain, et ainsi de suite. Pour éviter que vous receviez chaque fois un e-mail de notre part à ce sujet, nous avons marqué votre adresse e-mail comme instable.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Vérifiez que les serveurs de noms de votre nom de domaine sont correctement configurés et renvoient tous les mêmes enregistrements DNS.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Vous recevrez à nouveau un e-mail de notre part lorsque nous constaterons que le problème a été résolu. N\'hésitez pas à nous contacter si vous avez des questions à ce sujet.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{{platformName}}\"}]}]}},\"en\":{\"subject\":\"DNS records of {{mailDomain}} are unstable\",\"html\":\"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html>\\n\\n<head>\\n<meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n<meta http-equiv=\\\"X-UA-Compatible\\\" content=\\\"IE=edge\\\" />\\n<meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n<title>DNS records of {{mailDomain}} are unstable</title>\\n<style type=\\\"text/css\\\">body {\\n  color: #000716;\\n  color: var(--color-dark, #000716);\\n  font-family: -apple-system-body, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \\\"Apple Color Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Emoji\\\", \\\"Segoe UI Symbol\\\";\\n  font-size: 12pt;\\n  line-height: 1.4;\\n}\\n\\np {\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n  line-height: 1.4;\\n}\\n\\np.description {\\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\\n  font-size: 10pt;\\n}\\np.description a, p.description a:link, p.description a:visited, p.description a:active, p.description a:hover {\\n  text-decoration: underline;\\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\\n}\\n\\nstrong {\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n}\\n\\nem {\\n  font-style: italic;\\n}\\n\\nh1 {\\n  font-size: 30px;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  line-height: 1.2;\\n}\\n@media (max-width: 350px) {\\n  h1 {\\n    font-size: 24px;\\n  }\\n}\\nh1 {\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n}\\n\\nh2 {\\n  font-size: 20px;\\n  line-height: 1.2;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n}\\n\\nh3 {\\n  font-size: 16px;\\n  line-height: 1.2;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n}\\n\\nh4 {\\n  line-height: 1.2;\\n  font-weight: 500;\\n  margin: 0;\\n  padding: 0;\\n}\\n\\nol, ul {\\n  list-style-position: outside;\\n  padding-left: 30px;\\n}\\n\\nhr {\\n  height: 1px;\\n  background: var(--color-border, var(--color-gray-2, #dcdcdc));\\n  border-radius: 1px;\\n  padding: 0;\\n  margin: 20px 0;\\n  outline: none;\\n  border: 0;\\n}\\n\\n.button {\\n  touch-action: inherit;\\n  user-select: auto;\\n  cursor: pointer;\\n  display: inline-block !important;\\n  line-height: 42px;\\n  font-size: 16px;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  text-box-trim: none;\\n}\\n.button:active {\\n  transform: none;\\n}\\n\\nimg {\\n  max-width: 100%;\\n  height: auto;\\n}\\n\\na, a:link, a:visited, a:active, a:hover {\\n  text-decoration: underline;\\n  color: blue;\\n}\\n\\n.email-data-table {\\n  width: 100%;\\n  border-collapse: collapse;\\n}\\n.email-data-table th, .email-data-table td {\\n  text-align: left;\\n  padding: 10px 10px 10px 0;\\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border, var(--color-gray-2, #dcdcdc));\\n  vertical-align: middle;\\n}\\n.email-data-table th:last-child, .email-data-table td:last-child {\\n  text-align: right;\\n  padding-right: 0;\\n}\\n.email-data-table td.price {\\n  white-space: nowrap;\\n}\\n.email-data-table thead {\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n}\\n.email-data-table thead th {\\n  font-size: 10pt;\\n}\\n.email-data-table h4 ~ p {\\n  padding-top: 3px;\\n  opacity: 0.8;\\n  font-size: 11pt;\\n}\\n\\n.style-inline-code {\\n  font-family: monospace;\\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\\n  display: inline-block;\\n  letter-spacing: 1%;\\n}\\n\\n.style-code-large {\\n  font-family: monospace;\\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\\n  font-size: 16pt;\\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\\n  background: #f2f2f2;\\n  padding: 6px 10px;\\n  border-radius: 6px;\\n  display: inline-block;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-description-small {\\n  font-size: 14px;\\n  line-height: 1.5;\\n  font-weight: normal;\\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\\n  font-variation-settings: \\\"opsz\\\" 19;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-title-list {\\n  font-size: 16px;\\n  line-height: 1.3;\\n  font-weight: 500;\\n}\\n.email-style-title-list + p {\\n  padding-top: 3px;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-title-prefix-list {\\n  font-size: 11px;\\n  line-height: 1.5;\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  color: {{primaryColor}};\\n  text-transform: uppercase;\\n  margin-bottom: 3px;\\n}\\n.email-style-title-prefix-list.error {\\n  color: #f0153d;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-price-base, .email-style-discount-price, .email-style-discount-old-price, .email-style-price {\\n  font-size: 15px;\\n  line-height: 1.4;\\n  font-weight: 500;\\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\\n}\\n.email-style-price-base.disabled, .disabled.email-style-discount-price, .disabled.email-style-discount-old-price, .disabled.email-style-price {\\n  opacity: 0.6;\\n}\\n.email-style-price-base.negative, .negative.email-style-discount-price, .negative.email-style-discount-old-price, .negative.email-style-price {\\n  color: #f0153d;\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-price {\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  color: {{primaryColor}};\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-discount-old-price {\\n  text-decoration: line-through;\\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\\n}\\n\\n.email-style-discount-price {\\n  font-weight: bold;\\n  color: #ff4747;\\n  margin-left: 5px;\\n}\\n\\n.pre-wrap {\\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\\n} hr {height: 2px;background: #e7e7e7; border-radius: 1px; padding: 0; margin: 20px 0; outline: none; border: 0;} .button.primary { margin: 0; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; color: {{primaryColorContrast}}; padding: 0 27px; line-height: 42px; background: {{primaryColor}}; text-align: center; border-radius: 7px; touch-action: manipulation; display: inline-block; transition: 0.2s transform, 0.2s opacity; } .button.primary:active { transform: scale(0.95, 0.95); }  .inline-link, .inline-link:link, .inline-link:visited, .inline-link:active, .inline-link:hover { margin: 0; text-decoration: underline; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; color: inherit; touch-action: manipulation; } .inline-link:active { opacity: 0.5; }  .description { color: #5e5e5e; } </style>\\n</head>\\n\\n<body>\\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">{{greeting}}</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">This is a technical email intended for your webmaster.</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">{{platformName}} automatically checks every day whether your domain name {{mailDomain}}, which is connected to {{organizationName}} on {{platformName}}, is still configured correctly. This is required for sending emails via your email addresses, but possibly also for your member portal if you use the member administration.</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">For a while now we have noticed that at one moment your domain name is configured correctly, and the next day it is not anymore, and so on. To prevent you from receiving an email from us about this every time, we have marked your email address as unstable.</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">Check whether the nameservers of your domain name are configured correctly and all return the same DNS records.</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">You will receive another email from us when we notice that the problem has been resolved. Feel free to contact us if you have any questions about this.</p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\"><br></p><p style=\\\"margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.4;\\\">{{platformName}}</p>\\n</body>\\n\\n</html>\",\"text\":\"{{greeting}}\\n\\nThis is a technical email intended for your webmaster.\\n\\n{{platformName}} automatically checks every day whether your domain name {{mailDomain}}, which is connected to {{organizationName}} on {{platformName}}, is still configured correctly. This is required for sending emails via your email addresses, but possibly also for your member portal if you use the member administration.\\n\\nFor a while now we have noticed that at one moment your domain name is configured correctly, and the next day it is not anymore, and so on. To prevent you from receiving an email from us about this every time, we have marked your email address as unstable.\\n\\nCheck whether the nameservers of your domain name are configured correctly and all return the same DNS records.\\n\\nYou will receive another email from us when we notice that the problem has been resolved. Feel free to contact us if you have any questions about this.\\n\\n{{platformName}}\",\"json\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"greeting\"}}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"This is a technical email intended for your webmaster.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{{platformName}} automatically checks every day whether your domain name \"},{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"mailDomain\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\", which is connected to \"},{\"type\":\"smartVariable\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"organizationName\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" on {{platformName}}, is still configured correctly. This is required for sending emails via your email addresses, but possibly also for your member portal if you use the member administration.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"For a while now we have noticed that at one moment your domain name is configured correctly, and the next day it is not anymore, and so on. To prevent you from receiving an email from us about this every time, we have marked your email address as unstable.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Check whether the nameservers of your domain name are configured correctly and all return the same DNS records.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"You will receive another email from us when we notice that the problem has been resolved. Feel free to contact us if you have any questions about this.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{{platformName}}\"}]}]}}},\"version\":413}', 'nl'),
('61199699-492f-4fd3-a966-ca75179c3e71', '', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'DefaultPaymentsEmail', '{{greeting}}\n\nBetaalinstructies\n{{paymentTable}}\n\n{{overviewContext}}\n\n{{overviewTable}}\nTotaal: {{priceToPay}}\n\nKomt deze e-mail bij jou terecht, maar weet je niet waarover dit gaat en denk je dat dit aan een andere persoon is gericht (bv. een typefout)? Dan schrijf je best uit voor onze e-mails via deze knop ({{unsubscribeUrl}}) — hierna zal je nooit meer een e-mail van ons ontvangen.\nUitschrijven ({{unsubscribeUrl}})', '<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0\" />\n<title></title>\n<style type=\"text/css\">body {\n  color: #000716;\n  color: var(--color-dark, #000716);\n  font-family: -apple-system-body, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \"Apple Color Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Symbol\";\n  font-size: 12pt;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n\np {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n  line-height: 1.4;\n}\n\np.description {\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\n}\np.description a, p.description a:link, p.description a:visited, p.description a:active, p.description a:hover {\n  text-decoration: underline;\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\n}\n\nstrong {\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n\nem {\n  font-style: italic;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 30px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n@media (max-width: 350px) {\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 24px;\n  }\n}\n\nh2 {\n  font-size: 20px;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nh3 {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nh4 {\n  line-height: 1.2;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nol, ul {\n  list-style-position: outside;\n  padding-left: 30px;\n}\n\nhr {\n  height: 1px;\n  background: var(--color-border, var(--color-gray-2, #dcdcdc));\n  border-radius: 1px;\n  padding: 0;\n  margin: 20px 0;\n  outline: none;\n  border: 0;\n}\n\n.button {\n  touch-action: inherit;\n  user-select: auto;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  display: inline-block !important;\n  line-height: 42px;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n.button:active {\n  transform: none;\n}\n\nimg {\n  max-width: 100%;\n  height: auto;\n}\n\na, a:link, a:visited, a:active, a:hover {\n  text-decoration: underline;\n  color: blue;\n}\n\n.email-data-table {\n  width: 100%;\n  border-collapse: collapse;\n}\n.email-data-table th, .email-data-table td {\n  text-align: left;\n  padding: 10px 10px 10px 0;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border, var(--color-gray-2, #dcdcdc));\n  vertical-align: middle;\n}\n.email-data-table th:last-child, .email-data-table td:last-child {\n  text-align: right;\n  padding-right: 0;\n}\n.email-data-table td.price {\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n.email-data-table thead {\n  font-weight: bold;\n}\n.email-data-table thead th {\n  font-size: 10pt;\n}\n.email-data-table h4 ~ p {\n  padding-top: 3px;\n  opacity: 0.8;\n  font-size: 11pt;\n}\n\n.email-style-inline-code {\n  font-family: monospace;\n  white-space: pre-wrap;\n  display: inline-block;\n}\n\n.email-style-description-small {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  font-weight: normal;\n  color: var(--color-gray-4, #5e5e5e);\n  font-variation-settings: \"opsz\" 19;\n}\n\n.email-style-title-list {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  line-height: 1.3;\n  font-weight: 500;\n}\n.email-style-title-list + p {\n  padding-top: 3px;\n}\n\n.email-style-title-prefix-list {\n  font-size: 11px;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  color: {{primaryColor}};\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  margin-bottom: 3px;\n}\n.email-style-title-prefix-list.error {\n  color: #f0153d;\n}\n\n.email-style-price-base, .email-style-discount-price, .email-style-discount-old-price, .email-style-price {\n  font-size: 15px;\n  line-he